{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JawrrH5EeQMevwUvqYPSxZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Reframe: joint estimation is methodologically principled AND\n2\t  provides unique diagnostic value, even when ranking improvement is modest. Claim\n3\t  1 softened to \"confounding exists and is detectable\" (mechanism, not magnitude).\n4\t  Claim 3 softened to \"comparable or better rankings PLUS interpretable diagnostics\n5\t  no baseline provides.\" Elevate per-model c_n, per-judge d_j, per-item e_i as co-primary\n6\t  contribution. Lead with \"unified diagnostic framework\" angle. Add subset analysis:\n7\t  show G-MFRM advantage is concentrated on high-contamination models (top quartile\n8\t  c_n). AAAI positioning viable but needs strong writing; ARR backup advisable.\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n13\t  plan_id: exp-001\n14\t  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench (80 items × 2 turns)\n15\t    and Arena-Hard (500 items) using 8 judges, evaluating 22 target models with position\n16\t    swap.\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    total_judges: 8\n21\t    judge_list: GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B,\n22\t      Qwen3.6-27B, Llama-4-Maverick, Gemini-2.5-Pro\n23\t    total_target_models: 22\n24\t    mt_bench_items: 160\n25\t    arena_hard_items: 500\n26\t    total_judgments_planned: 232320\n27\t    total_judgments_collected: 219874\n28\t    collection_completion_rate: 0.9464\n29\t    api_failure_rate: 0.031\n30\t    refusal_rate: 0.023\n31\t    position_swap_agreement: 0.72\n32\t    inter_judge_fleiss_kappa: 0.38\n33\t    pairwise_judge_agreement_mean: 0.64\n34\t    pairwise_judge_agreement_std: 0.09\n35\t    uda_response_collection_rate: 0.98\n36\t    api_cost_usd: 847\n37\t    vllm_gpu_hours: 118\n38\t    total_wall_clock_days: 11\n39\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，数据收集本身是工程问题而非统计问题，完成率主要取决于 API 稳定性和 judge 拒答率。 95%\n40\t    完成率符合实际 API 可用性（GPT-5.5/Claude 偶发限速，开源模型 vLLM 偶发 OOM）。 Fleiss κ ≈ 0.38 反映 LLM\n41\t    judge 的已知分歧水平（Zheng et al. 2023 报告类似数值）， 说明 judge 间存在系统性差异——这正是 d_j 参数需要建模的信号。\n42\t    Position swap agreement 0.72 表明位置偏差存在但不占主导，与已有文献一致。 收集 UDA 所需的 judge response\n43\t    generation 增加约 15% 时间但不影响数据质量。\n44\t\n45\t    '\n46\t  tables:\n47\t  - name: judge_coverage_matrix\n48\t    caption: Judge × Benchmark coverage (fraction of completed evaluations)\n49\t    columns:\n50\t    - Judge\n51\t    - MT-Bench\n52\t    - Arena-Hard\n53\t    - Overall\n54\t    rows:\n55\t    - - GPT-5.5\n56\t      - '0.99'\n57\t      - '0.98'\n58\t      - '0.984'\n59\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n60\t      - '0.98'\n61\t      - '0.97'\n62\t      - '0.974'\n63\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n64\t      - '0.99'\n65\t      - '0.98'\n66\t      - '0.984'\n67\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n68\t      - '0.97'\n69\t      - '0.95'\n70\t      - '0.958'\n71\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n72\t      - '0.96'\n73\t      - '0.93'\n74\t      - '0.942'\n75\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n76\t      - '0.94'\n77\t      - '0.91'\n78\t      - '0.922'\n79\t    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n80\t      - '0.95'\n81\t      - '0.92'\n82\t      - '0.932'\n83\t    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n84\t      - '0.98'\n85\t      - '0.96'\n86\t      - '0.968'\n87\t  - name: inter_judge_agreement\n88\t    caption: Pairwise judge agreement rate (MT-Bench + Arena-Hard combined)\n89\t    columns:\n90\t    - Judge Pair\n91\t    - Agreement Rate\n92\t    - Cohen Kappa\n93\t    rows:\n94\t    - - GPT-5.5 vs Claude Opus 4.7\n95\t      - '0.71'\n96\t      - '0.42'\n97\t    - - GPT-5.5 vs DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n98\t      - '0.65'\n99\t      - '0.33'\n100\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7 vs Claude Sonnet 4.6\n101\t      - '0.76'\n102\t      - '0.51'\n103\t    - - Proprietary mean\n104\t      - '0.69'\n105\t      - '0.39'\n106\t    - - Open-source mean\n107\t      - '0.61'\n108\t      - '0.28'\n109\t    - - Cross-type mean\n110\t      - '0.64'\n111\t      - '0.32'\n112\t  figures_description:\n113\t  - 'Judge agreement heatmap: 8×8 matrix showing pairwise Cohen κ. Proprietary judges\n114\t    form a mild cluster (κ ≈ 0.39-0.51), open-source judges more dispersed (κ ≈ 0.22-0.35).\n115\t    This clustering motivates modeling d_j rather than treating judges as exchangeable.'\n116\t  - 'Position bias distribution: histogram of per-item position swap disagreement\n117\t    rate across items. Right tail (disagreement > 0.5) concentrated in Arena-Hard\n118\t    coding/math items, suggesting position bias is item-type dependent.'\n119\t  analysis: '数据收集成功，覆盖率满足建模需求。关键发现：(1) 开源 judge 的覆盖率略低于 API judge， 主要因 vLLM 内存限制导致长输出截断；(2)\n120\t    judge 间分歧显著（κ = 0.38），尤其在 主观评价维度（创造性、细致性），验证了 MFRM 对 d_j 建模的必要性； (3) 同家族 judge\n121\t    对（如 Claude Opus vs Sonnet）agreement 更高，暗示 preference leakage 效应存在但可控。数据量足够支撑 8-facet\n122\t    MFRM 拟合。\n123\t\n124\t    '\n125\t- name: item_exposure_estimation\n126\t  plan_id: exp-002\n127\t  description: 'Estimate per-item exposure e_i via three-source weighted composite\n128\t    pipeline: performance gap (primary), temporal signal, LogProber scores.\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  expected_results:\n132\t    total_items_mtbench: 160\n133\t    total_items_arenahard: 500\n134\t    reference_variants_created: 627\n135\t    reference_variant_quality_pass_rate: 0.87\n136\t    performance_gap_coverage: 0.95\n137\t    temporal_signal_coverage: 0.41\n138\t    logprober_coverage: 0.55\n139\t    composite_weights_performance_gap: 0.62\n140\t    composite_weights_temporal: 0.18\n141\t    composite_weights_logprober: 0.2\n142\t    ei_mean: 0.34\n143\t    ei_std: 0.22\n144\t    ei_median: 0.29\n145\t    ei_range:\n146\t    - 0.02\n147\t    - 0.91\n148\t    ei_internal_consistency_alpha: 0.43\n149\t    ei_split_half_reliability: 0.39\n150\t    ei_spearman_gap_vs_logprober: 0.48\n151\t    ei_spearman_gap_vs_temporal: 0.36\n152\t    ei_spearman_logprober_vs_temporal: 0.31\n153\t    high_exposure_items_fraction: 0.18\n154\t    near_zero_exposure_items_fraction: 0.32\n155\t    effective_sigma_e: 0.24\n156\t    mtbench_ei_mean: 0.42\n157\t    arenahard_ei_mean: 0.29\n158\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：e_i pipeline 有噪声（effective σ_e ≈ 0.2-0.3），但聚合信号有效。\n159\t    内部一致性 α ≈ 0.43 处于 [0.3, 0.55] 范围中部，反映三个信号源测量的是相关但非同一构念： performance gap 捕获训练集泄露的综合效应，LogProber\n160\t    捕获逐字记忆，temporal 捕获时间窗口效应。 这三者在 \"contamination\" 的广义定义下相关（r ≈ 0.3-0.5），但各自噪声源不同。\n161\t    MT-Bench e_i 均值高于 Arena-Hard 因为 MT-Bench 发布更早、被更多训练数据包含。 约 18% 的 item 有高暴露度（e_i\n162\t    > 0.7），集中在 MT-Bench 的经典题目（如 math/coding 常见题型） 和 Arena-Hard 的早期发布题目。32% 近零暴露主要是\n163\t    Arena-Hard 的新增/冷门题目。 Reference variant 构建的主要瓶颈在于保持语义等价性同时改变表面形式—— 约 13% 的 item\n164\t    因结构化输出（代码、数学公式）难以有效改写。\n165\t\n166\t    '\n167\t  tables:\n168\t  - name: ei_source_statistics\n169\t    caption: Per-source e_i estimation statistics\n170\t    columns:\n171\t    - Source\n172\t    - Coverage\n173\t    - Mean e_i\n174\t    - Std\n175\t    - Weight\n176\t    rows:\n177\t    - - Performance Gap\n178\t      - '0.95'\n179\t      - '0.36'\n180\t      - '0.24'\n181\t      - '0.62'\n182\t    - - Temporal Signal\n183\t      - '0.41'\n184\t      - '0.31'\n185\t      - '0.19'\n186\t      - '0.18'\n187\t    - - LogProber\n188\t      - '0.55'\n189\t      - '0.33'\n190\t      - '0.26'\n191\t      - '0.20'\n192\t    - - Composite\n193\t      - '1.00'\n194\t      - '0.34'\n195\t      - '0.22'\n196\t      - —\n197\t  - name: ei_by_benchmark_category\n198\t    caption: Mean e_i by benchmark and item category\n199\t    columns:\n200\t    - Benchmark\n201\t    - Category\n202\t    - N Items\n203\t    - Mean e_i\n204\t    - Std e_i\n205\t    rows:\n206\t    - - MT-Bench\n207\t      - Writing\n208\t      - '20'\n209\t      - '0.38'\n210\t      - '0.21'\n211\t    - - MT-Bench\n212\t      - Roleplay\n213\t      - '20'\n214\t      - '0.31'\n215\t      - '0.18'\n216\t    - - MT-Bench\n217\t      - Reasoning\n218\t      - '20'\n219\t      - '0.52'\n220\t      - '0.24'\n221\t    - - MT-Bench\n222\t      - Math\n223\t      - '20'\n224\t      - '0.56'\n225\t      - '0.22'\n226\t    - - MT-Bench\n227\t      - Coding\n228\t      - '20'\n229\t      - '0.49'\n230\t      - '0.25'\n231\t    - - MT-Bench\n232\t      - Extraction\n233\t      - '20'\n234\t      - '0.35'\n235\t      - '0.19'\n236\t    - - MT-Bench\n237\t      - STEM\n238\t      - '20'\n239\t      - '0.44'\n240\t      - '0.23'\n241\t    - - MT-Bench\n242\t      - Humanities\n243\t      - '20'\n244\t      - '0.33'\n245\t      - '0.17'\n246\t    - - Arena-Hard\n247\t      - All\n248\t      - '500'\n249\t      - '0.29'\n250\t      - '0.21'\n251\t  figures_description:\n252\t  - 'e_i histogram: bimodal distribution with peak near 0.1 (unexposed items) and\n253\t    secondary mode near 0.5 (moderately exposed). Long right tail to 0.9. MT-Bench\n254\t    items shifted right relative to Arena-Hard.'\n255\t  - 'Source agreement scatter: 3-panel plot (gap vs logprober, gap vs temporal, logprober\n256\t    vs temporal). Moderate positive correlations (r = 0.48, 0.36, 0.31) with substantial\n257\t    scatter, illustrating why composite is needed.'\n258\t  - 'Reference variant quality: scatter of original score vs reference score per item,\n259\t    colored by e_i. High-e_i items show larger gaps (as expected). Regression line\n260\t    with 95% CI band.'\n261\t  analysis: 'e_i pipeline 在 median 档下表现符合预期：噪声较大但聚合后可用。关键限制是 temporal signal 覆盖率仅\n262\t    41%（许多 item 缺乏明确时间切分点），LogProber 受限于 仅 API 模型提供 logprob。MT-Bench 的 Math/Coding/Reasoning\n263\t    类目 e_i 最高， 符合直觉——这些是训练数据中最常见的 benchmark 题型。e_i 的有效 σ_e ≈ 0.24 将在 Stage 3 引入 c_n\n264\t    估计噪声，但 exp-012 已证明 σ ≤ 0.2 下 θ 稳健。 这意味着 e_i 估计质量处于 exp-012 稳健性阈值的边缘，需在论文 Limitations\n265\t    中讨论。\n266\t\n267\t    '\n268\t- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n269\t  plan_id: exp-003\n270\t  description: 'Fit G-MFRM three-stage pipeline on real data. Stage 1: MFRM. Stage\n271\t    2: e_i from exp-002. Stage 3: Joint gated model. Compare with Chatbot Arena Kendall-τ.\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  expected_results:\n275\t    stage1_rhat_max: 1.02\n276\t    stage1_ess_min: 412\n277\t    stage1_runtime_seconds: 1840\n278\t    stage1_theta_tau_arena: 0.794\n279\t    stage3_rhat_max: 1.06\n280\t    stage3_ess_min: 132\n281\t    stage3_runtime_seconds: 8720\n282\t    stage3_warmup: 3000\n283\t    stage3_samples: 5000\n284\t    stage3_chains: 4\n285\t    stage3_thinning: 2\n286\t    stage3_divergent_transitions: 14\n287\t    theta_tau_arena_gmfrm: 0.823\n288\t    theta_tau_arena_mfrm: 0.794\n289\t    theta_tau_arena_raw_avg: 0.761\n290\t    theta_spearman_arena_gmfrm: 0.857\n291\t    theta_spearman_arena_mfrm: 0.831\n292\t    cn_median: 0.48\n293\t    cn_mean: 0.56\n294\t    cn_std: 0.39\n295\t    cn_range:\n296\t    - 0.04\n297\t    - 1.42\n298\t    cn_top_quartile_mean: 1.02\n299\t    cn_bottom_quartile_mean: 0.11\n300\t    dj_range:\n301\t    - -0.83\n302\t    - 0.91\n303\t    dj_std: 0.48\n304\t    dj_harshest_judge: DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n305\t    dj_most_lenient_judge: GPT-5.5\n306\t    mtbench_tau_gmfrm: 0.811\n307\t    mtbench_tau_mfrm: 0.783\n308\t    arenahard_tau_gmfrm: 0.831\n309\t    arenahard_tau_mfrm: 0.802\n310\t    low_contam_benchmark_tau_gmfrm: 0.806\n311\t    low_contam_benchmark_tau_mfrm: 0.801\n312\t    graceful_degradation_pass: true\n313\t    max_theta_shift_stage1_to_stage3: 0.34\n314\t    models_with_shift_gt_0_2: 5\n315\t    models_with_shift_gt_0_1: 11\n316\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，real c_n 分布中位数 ≈ 0.48，属于 weak-to-moderate 污染。G-MFRM\n317\t    的 Kendall-τ = 0.823 显著优于 raw average (0.761) 但仅小幅优于 MFRM-only (0.794)， 因为 MFRM\n318\t    本身已通过 d_j 修正了相当部分偏差。Stage 3 的边际改善来自 c_n·e_i 项对高污染模型（top quartile, c̄ ≈ 1.02）的修正——这些模型在\n319\t    Stage 1 中 θ̂ 被 系统性高估。收敛性方面，R̂ = 1.06 和 ESS = 132 处于可接受范围但不如 mvp_003 (R̂=1.03,\n320\t    ESS=224)，因为真实数据的模型数(22)多于合成(20)，item 数(660)远多于 合成(50)，且 e_i 携带估计噪声。需要 thinning=2\n321\t    和延长 warmup=3000 来控制 自相关。14 个 divergent transitions 占总样本 <0.1%，在可接受范围内但需报告。 Arena-Hard\n322\t    的 τ 高于 MT-Bench 因为 Arena-Hard item 数更多，估计更稳定。 Graceful degradation 验证通过：在低污染 benchmark\n323\t    子集上 G-MFRM 几乎退化为 MFRM。\n324\t\n325\t    '\n326\t  tables:\n327\t  - name: three_stage_summary\n328\t    caption: G-MFRM three-stage pipeline results on real data\n329\t    columns:\n330\t    - Stage\n331\t    - Parameters\n332\t    - R-hat max\n333\t    - ESS min\n334\t    - Runtime (s)\n335\t    - Arena tau\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - - Stage 1 (MFRM)\n338\t      - theta, b, d\n339\t      - '1.02'\n340\t      - '412'\n341\t      - '1840'\n342\t      - '0.794'\n343\t    - - Stage 2 (e_i)\n344\t      - e_i fixed from pipeline\n345\t      - —\n346\t      - —\n347\t      - —\n348\t      - —\n349\t    - - Stage 3 (Joint)\n350\t      - theta, b, d, c\n351\t      - '1.06'\n352\t      - '132'\n353\t      - '8720'\n354\t      - '0.823'\n355\t  - name: model_ranking_top10\n356\t    caption: Top-10 model ranking comparison (Arena Elo vs G-MFRM θ̂ vs Raw Average)\n357\t    columns:\n358\t    - Arena Rank\n359\t    - Model\n360\t    - Arena Elo\n361\t    - G-MFRM Rank\n362\t    - Raw Avg Rank\n363\t    - c_n\n364\t    - theta shift\n365\t    rows:\n366\t    - - '1'\n367\t      - GPT-5.5\n368\t      - '1347'\n369\t      - '1'\n370\t      - '1'\n371\t      - '0.31'\n372\t      - '-0.04'\n373\t    - - '2'\n374\t      - Claude Opus 4.7\n375\t      - '1338'\n376\t      - '2'\n377\t      - '3'\n378\t      - '0.22'\n379\t      - '-0.02'\n380\t    - - '3'\n381\t      - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n382\t      - '1329'\n383\t      - '3'\n384\t      - '2'\n385\t      - '0.58'\n386\t      - '-0.12'\n387\t    - - '4'\n388\t      - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n389\t      - '1311'\n390\t      - '4'\n391\t      - '6'\n392\t      - '0.15'\n393\t      - '+0.01'\n394\t    - - '5'\n395\t      - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n396\t      - '1298'\n397\t      - '6'\n398\t      - '5'\n399\t      - '0.41'\n400\t      - '-0.08'\n401\t    - - '6'\n402\t      - Llama-4-Maverick\n403\t      - '1285'\n404\t      - '5'\n405\t      - '7'\n406\t      - '0.09'\n407\t      - '+0.03'\n408\t    - - '7'\n409\t      - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n410\t      - '1271'\n411\t      - '7'\n412\t      - '4'\n413\t      - '1.12'\n414\t      - '-0.27'\n415\t    - - '8'\n416\t      - GPT-4.5\n417\t      - '1258'\n418\t      - '8'\n419\t      - '8'\n420\t      - '0.72'\n421\t      - '-0.15'\n422\t    - - '9'\n423\t      - Mistral-Large-3\n424\t      - '1241'\n425\t      - '9'\n426\t      - '10'\n427\t      - '0.38'\n428\t      - '-0.05'\n429\t    - - '10'\n430\t      - Qwen3.6-27B\n431\t      - '1224'\n432\t      - '10'\n433\t      - '9'\n434\t      - '0.85'\n435\t      - '-0.19'\n436\t  - name: judge_severity_estimates\n437\t    caption: Estimated judge severity d_j (positive = harsher)\n438\t    columns:\n439\t    - Judge\n440\t    - d_j (mean)\n441\t    - d_j (95% CI)\n442\t    - Infit MNSQ\n443\t    rows:\n444\t    - - GPT-5.5\n445\t      - '-0.83'\n446\t      - '[-1.02, -0.64]'\n447\t      - '0.94'\n448\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n449\t      - '-0.31'\n450\t      - '[-0.48, -0.14]'\n451\t      - '1.08'\n452\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n453\t      - '-0.12'\n454\t      - '[-0.29, 0.05]'\n455\t      - '1.02'\n456\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n457\t      - '0.91'\n458\t      - '[0.72, 1.10]'\n459\t      - '1.15'\n460\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n461\t      - '0.44'\n462\t      - '[0.26, 0.62]'\n463\t      - '1.21'\n464\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n465\t      - '0.62'\n466\t      - '[0.43, 0.81]'\n467\t      - '1.18'\n468\t    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n469\t      - '0.15'\n470\t      - '[-0.03, 0.33]'\n471\t      - '0.97'\n472\t    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n473\t      - '-0.22'\n474\t      - '[-0.40, -0.04]'\n475\t      - '1.05'\n476\t  figures_description:\n477\t  - 'Wright map (variable map): vertical axis = logit scale. Left side: model θ̂ distribution.\n478\t    Right side: item b̂ distribution, judge d̂ points. Shows alignment of model ability\n479\t    with item difficulty, plus judge spread.'\n480\t  - 'c_n posterior density plot: 22 overlapping density curves (one per model), x-axis\n481\t    = c_n. Top-quartile models clearly separated from bottom-quartile. Dashed vertical\n482\t    line at c_n = 0 (no contamination reference).'\n483\t  - 'θ shift scatter: x = Stage 1 θ̂ (MFRM), y = Stage 3 θ̂ (G-MFRM). Points colored\n484\t    by c_n. High-c_n models shift downward (contamination correction), low-c_n models\n485\t    stay near identity line.'\n486\t  - 'Trace plots: 4 panels for representative θ, d, c, b parameters showing chain\n487\t    mixing. Chains visually mixed but with mild autocorrelation visible in c_n traces.'\n488\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在真实数据上收敛可接受但不如合成数据理想。τ = 0.823 vs MFRM 的 0.794 表明 contamination\n489\t    修正提供了边际但正向的排名改善。关键观察：修正集中于 top-quartile c_n 模型（如 Qwen3-235B-A22B, c_n = 1.12），这些模型的\n490\t    raw ranking 被系统性高估。 Judge severity 估计显示 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 最严厉（d = 0.91），GPT-5.5\n491\t    最宽松（d = -0.83）， 范围 1.74 logits 对应约 1.5 个评分等级的系统偏差。这为 Claim 1 提供了直接证据： 如果不建模 d_j，contamination\n492\t    信号会被 judge 差异所混淆。 Graceful degradation 通过验证——在低污染 item 子集上，Stage 3 结果与 Stage 1\n493\t    近似。\n494\t\n495\t    '\n496\t- name: baseline_comparison\n497\t  plan_id: exp-004\n498\t  description: 'Compare G-MFRM against 8 baselines. Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ\n499\t    with Chatbot Arena. Include rank change analysis and post-hoc power analysis.\n500\t\n501\t    '\n502\t  expected_results:\n503\t    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.761\n504\t    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.794\n505\t    kendall_tau_sequential_bias_first: 0.788\n506\t    kendall_tau_sequential_contam_first: 0.791\n507\t    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge: 0.802\n508\t    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.798\n509\t    kendall_tau_dcr: 0.779\n510\t    kendall_tau_uda: 0.805\n511\t    kendall_tau_prefleak: 0.783\n512\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm: 0.823\n513\t    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.857\n514\t    spearman_rho_uda: 0.841\n515\t    spearman_rho_mfrm: 0.831\n516\t    best_baseline: UDA\n517\t    best_baseline_tau: 0.805\n518\t    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.018\n519\t    delta_tau_p_value_wilcoxon: 0.067\n520\t    delta_tau_95ci:\n521\t    - 0.002\n522\t    - 0.034\n523\t    top5_overlap_gmfrm: 0.8\n524\t    top5_overlap_uda: 0.8\n525\t    top5_overlap_raw: 0.6\n526\t    top10_overlap_gmfrm: 0.9\n527\t    top10_overlap_uda: 0.8\n528\t    top10_overlap_raw: 0.7\n529\t    mean_absolute_rank_change_gmfrm_vs_raw: 2.3\n530\t    max_rank_change_gmfrm_vs_raw: 5\n531\t    models_with_rank_change_ge_3: 4\n532\t    tau_gmfrm_high_contam_subset: 0.867\n533\t    tau_uda_high_contam_subset: 0.782\n534\t    tau_mfrm_high_contam_subset: 0.745\n535\t    delta_tau_high_contam: 0.085\n536\t    delta_tau_high_contam_p: 0.021\n537\t    posthoc_power_full_sample: 0.58\n538\t    posthoc_power_high_contam_subset: 0.74\n539\t    n_models: 22\n540\t    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.42\n541\t    n_required_for_power_0_80: 35\n542\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Δτ = 0.018（vs best baseline UDA），p = 0.067，borderline\n543\t    significant。 这正是 median 档的核心特征：改善正向但小/边缘。原因链： (1) 真实 c_n 中位数 ≈ 0.48，多数模型污染较轻，MFRM\n544\t    的 d_j 修正已捕获大部分偏差； (2) UDA 的神经网络 K-factor 调整能部分隐式学到 contamination 信号（尽管不可解释）， 所以\n545\t    UDA 是最强 baseline；(3) CyclicJudge+discard 反而略低于 CyclicJudge alone， 因为丢弃高暴露 item\n546\t    减少了信息量，在 N=22 模型下加大估计方差； (4) 关键亮点在 subset analysis：限制到 high-contamination top\n547\t    quartile (c_n > 0.75) 时，Δτ = 0.085，p = 0.021——G-MFRM 优势集中于最需修正的模型。 Post-hoc power\n548\t    = 0.58 < 0.80，说明 N=22 不足以可靠检测这个效应量。 这必须在论文中坦诚报告，但 subset analysis 部分缓解了 power\n549\t    不足的叙事问题。 Sequential pipelines 两个方向（bias-first, contam-first）均劣于 joint estimation，\n550\t    验证了 OVB confounding 的方向性预测。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t  tables:\n554\t  - name: main_comparison_table\n555\t    caption: Method comparison on MT-Bench + Arena-Hard (Chatbot Arena Elo as reference)\n556\t    columns:\n557\t    - Method\n558\t    - Kendall tau\n559\t    - Spearman rho\n560\t    - Top-5 Overlap\n561\t    - Top-10 Overlap\n562\t    - Mean |Rank Delta|\n563\t    rows:\n564\t    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n565\t      - '0.761'\n566\t      - '0.812'\n567\t      - '0.6'\n568\t      - '0.7'\n569\t      - '3.1'\n570\t    - - MFRM-only\n571\t      - '0.794'\n572\t      - '0.831'\n573\t      - '0.8'\n574\t      - '0.8'\n575\t      - '2.1'\n576\t    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n577\t      - '0.788'\n578\t      - '0.824'\n579\t      - '0.6'\n580\t      - '0.8'\n581\t      - '2.4'\n582\t    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n583\t      - '0.791'\n584\t      - '0.828'\n585\t      - '0.8'\n586\t      - '0.8'\n587\t      - '2.2'\n588\t    - - CyclicJudge\n589\t      - '0.802'\n590\t      - '0.838'\n591\t      - '0.8'\n592\t      - '0.8'\n593\t      - '1.9'\n594\t    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n595\t      - '0.798'\n596\t      - '0.835'\n597\t      - '0.8'\n598\t      - '0.8'\n599\t      - '2.0'\n600\t    - - DCR Factor\n601\t      - '0.779'\n602\t      - '0.821'\n603\t      - '0.6'\n604\t      - '0.7'\n605\t      - '2.6'\n606\t    - - UDA\n607\t      - '0.805'\n608\t      - '0.841'\n609\t      - '0.8'\n610\t      - '0.8'\n611\t      - '1.8'\n612\t    - - PrefLeak Calibration\n613\t      - '0.783'\n614\t      - '0.822'\n615\t      - '0.6'\n616\t      - '0.8'\n617\t      - '2.5'\n618\t    - - G-MFRM (ours)\n619\t      - '0.823'\n620\t      - '0.857'\n621\t      - '0.8'\n622\t      - '0.9'\n623\t      - '1.5'\n624\t  - name: statistical_tests\n625\t    caption: Pairwise Wilcoxon signed-rank tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\n626\t    columns:\n627\t    - Baseline\n628\t    - Delta tau\n629\t    - p-value\n630\t    - Significant (alpha=0.05)?\n631\t    rows:\n632\t    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n633\t      - '+0.062'\n634\t      - '0.003'\n635\t      - 'Yes'\n636\t    - - MFRM-only\n637\t      - '+0.029'\n638\t      - '0.042'\n639\t      - 'Yes'\n640\t    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n641\t      - '+0.035'\n642\t      - '0.018'\n643\t      - 'Yes'\n644\t    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n645\t      - '+0.032'\n646\t      - '0.024'\n647\t      - 'Yes'\n648\t    - - CyclicJudge\n649\t      - '+0.021'\n650\t      - '0.089'\n651\t      - 'No'\n652\t    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n653\t      - '+0.025'\n654\t      - '0.058'\n655\t      - 'No'\n656\t    - - DCR Factor\n657\t      - '+0.044'\n658\t      - '0.008'\n659\t      - 'Yes'\n660\t    - - UDA\n661\t      - '+0.018'\n662\t      - '0.067'\n663\t      - 'No'\n664\t    - - PrefLeak Calibration\n665\t      - '+0.040'\n666\t      - '0.011'\n667\t      - 'Yes'\n668\t  - name: subset_analysis\n669\t    caption: G-MFRM advantage by contamination quartile\n670\t    columns:\n671\t    - c_n Quartile\n672\t    - N Models\n673\t    - c_n Range\n674\t    - tau G-MFRM\n675\t    - tau UDA\n676\t    - Delta tau\n677\t    - p-value\n678\t    rows:\n679\t    - - Q1 (lowest)\n680\t      - '6'\n681\t      - '[0.04, 0.18]'\n682\t      - '0.807'\n683\t      - '0.811'\n684\t      - '-0.004'\n685\t      - '0.812'\n686\t    - - Q2\n687\t      - '5'\n688\t      - '[0.22, 0.48]'\n689\t      - '0.815'\n690\t      - '0.802'\n691\t      - '+0.013'\n692\t      - '0.234'\n693\t    - - Q3\n694\t      - '5'\n695\t      - '[0.52, 0.75]'\n696\t      - '0.831'\n697\t      - '0.808'\n698\t      - '+0.023'\n699\t      - '0.109'\n700\t    - - Q4 (highest)\n701\t      - '6'\n702\t      - '[0.85, 1.42]'\n703\t      - '0.867'\n704\t      - '0.782'\n705\t      - '+0.085'\n706\t      - '0.021'\n707\t  - name: posthoc_power\n708\t    caption: Post-hoc power analysis for primary comparison\n709\t    columns:\n710\t    - Comparison\n711\t    - N\n712\t    - Observed Delta\n713\t    - Cohen d\n714\t    - Power (alpha=0.05)\n715\t    - N for Power=0.80\n716\t    rows:\n717\t    - - G-MFRM vs UDA (all)\n718\t      - '22'\n719\t      - '0.018'\n720\t      - '0.42'\n721\t      - '0.58'\n722\t      - '35'\n723\t    - - G-MFRM vs UDA (Q4)\n724\t      - '6'\n725\t      - '0.085'\n726\t      - '1.31'\n727\t      - '0.74'\n728\t      - '8'\n729\t    - - G-MFRM vs Sequential\n730\t      - '22'\n731\t      - '0.032'\n732\t      - '0.68'\n733\t      - '0.76'\n734\t      - '26'\n735\t  figures_description:\n736\t  - 'Rank comparison alluvial diagram: flows from Arena Elo ranking (left) through\n737\t    Raw Avg, UDA, G-MFRM rankings (right). Thick crossing flows highlight models whose\n738\t    rank changes most under G-MFRM correction. Qwen3-235B-A22B drops from Raw rank\n739\t    4 to G-MFRM rank 7.'\n740\t  - 'Bootstrap Δτ distribution: histogram of 10,000 bootstrap resamples of τ(G-MFRM)\n741\t    - τ(UDA). Distribution centered at 0.018, 95% CI [0.002, 0.034]. Dashed line at\n742\t    0. ~3.2% mass below 0.'\n743\t  - 'Subset analysis bar chart: Δτ (G-MFRM vs UDA) by c_n quartile. Clear monotonic\n744\t    increase from Q1 (-0.004) to Q4 (+0.085). Error bars show 95% bootstrap CI. Q4\n745\t    bar clearly above zero, Q1-Q2 overlap zero.'\n746\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在全样本上优于所有 baseline，但 vs UDA 的改善仅 borderline significant (p=0.067)。叙事策略：(1)\n747\t    全样本 Δτ 作为 Claim 3 的 \"comparable or better\" 证据； (2) Subset analysis 作为核心亮点——G-MFRM\n748\t    优势高度集中于 high-contamination 模型； (3) Post-hoc power 分析坦诚报告 power=0.58，讨论 N=22 的限制，\n749\t    建议未来工作扩展到 35+ models。 CyclicJudge+Discard 的反直觉结果（劣于 CyclicJudge alone）直接回应 Reviewer\n750\t    Concern #1： 丢弃 item 损失信息，在小 N 下尤其有害。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n754\t  plan_id: exp-005\n755\t  description: 'Estimate real contamination magnitude by comparing fitted c_n with\n756\t    MVP synthetic assumptions. Validate c_n against ConStat per-model delta.\n757\t\n758\t    '\n759\t  expected_results:\n760\t    cn_median: 0.48\n761\t    cn_mean: 0.56\n762\t    cn_std: 0.39\n763\t    cn_iqr:\n764\t    - 0.18\n765\t    - 0.82\n766\t    cn_max: 1.42\n767\t    cn_min: 0.04\n768\t    closest_mvp_regime: between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5)\n769\t    fraction_models_mvp001_regime: 0.68\n770\t    fraction_models_mvp002_regime: 0.18\n771\t    fraction_models_near_zero: 0.14\n772\t    cn_constat_pearson_r: 0.52\n773\t    cn_constat_spearman_rho: 0.56\n774\t    cn_constat_p_value: 0.013\n775\t    cn_constat_n: 22\n776\t    theta_bias_high_cn_mean: 0.21\n777\t    theta_bias_low_cn_mean: 0.03\n778\t    theta_bias_scatter_r: 0.35\n779\t    tier_determination: B\n780\t    narrative_recommendation: diagnostics as co-primary\n781\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下真实 c_n 中位数 ≈ 0.48，接近 mvp_001 的 c ≈ 0.5 水平。68% 的模型处于\n782\t    weak contamination 区间（c_n < 0.8），仅 18% 接近 mvp_002 的强污染水平。 这决定了 Tier B 叙事：ranking\n783\t    improvement 正向但 modest。 ConStat 验证相关 r = 0.52 处于 [0.4, 0.65] 范围中部——c_n 和 ConStat\n784\t    delta 测量的是相关但不完全相同的构念（G-MFRM c_n 条件于 d_j 和 b_i，ConStat delta 是 无条件测量），所以中等相关是合理的。高于\n785\t    0.4 表明 c_n 有外部效度； 低于 0.7 表明两者不是冗余的，G-MFRM 提供了独立信息。 θ-bias scatter r = 0.35 证明\n786\t    confounding 机制存在但效应量 modest： high-c_n 模型的 θ̂ 平均高估 0.21 logits，但对于 low-c_n 模型影响\n787\t    ≤ 0.03。 这将 Claim 1 锁定在 \"detectable mechanism\" 层面，而非 \"large practical impact\"。\n788\t\n789\t    '\n790\t  tables:\n791\t  - name: cn_distribution_summary\n792\t    caption: Real c_n distribution vs MVP synthetic assumptions\n793\t    columns:\n794\t    - Statistic\n795\t    - Real Data\n796\t    - mvp_001\n797\t    - mvp_002\n798\t    - mvp_003\n799\t    rows:\n800\t    - - Median c_n\n801\t      - '0.48'\n802\t      - '0.5'\n803\t      - '1.5'\n804\t      - '1.5'\n805\t    - - Mean c_n\n806\t      - '0.56'\n807\t      - '0.5'\n808\t      - '1.5'\n809\t      - '1.5'\n810\t    - - Std c_n\n811\t      - '0.39'\n812\t      - '0.25'\n813\t      - '0.5'\n814\t      - '0.5'\n815\t    - - Max c_n\n816\t      - '1.42'\n817\t      - '1.0'\n818\t      - '2.5'\n819\t      - '2.5'\n820\t    - - Fraction c_n > 1.0\n821\t      - '0.18'\n822\t      - '0.0'\n823\t      - '0.84'\n824\t      - '0.84'\n825\t  - name: cn_per_model\n826\t    caption: Per-model c_n estimates with ConStat validation\n827\t    columns:\n828\t    - Model\n829\t    - G-MFRM c_n\n830\t    - c_n 95% CI\n831\t    - ConStat Delta\n832\t    - Arena Elo\n833\t    rows:\n834\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n835\t      - '1.42'\n836\t      - '[0.98, 1.91]'\n837\t      - '0.82'\n838\t      - '1271'\n839\t    - - GPT-4.5\n840\t      - '0.72'\n841\t      - '[0.41, 1.08]'\n842\t      - '0.51'\n843\t      - '1258'\n844\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n845\t      - '0.85'\n846\t      - '[0.52, 1.22]'\n847\t      - '0.61'\n848\t      - '1224'\n849\t    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n850\t      - '0.58'\n851\t      - '[0.29, 0.91]'\n852\t      - '0.44'\n853\t      - '1329'\n854\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n855\t      - '0.41'\n856\t      - '[0.15, 0.71]'\n857\t      - '0.28'\n858\t      - '1298'\n859\t    - - Mistral-Large-3\n860\t      - '0.38'\n861\t      - '[0.12, 0.68]'\n862\t      - '0.30'\n863\t      - '1241'\n864\t    - - GPT-5.5\n865\t      - '0.31'\n866\t      - '[0.08, 0.58]'\n867\t      - '0.21'\n868\t      - '1347'\n869\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n870\t      - '0.22'\n871\t      - '[0.03, 0.47]'\n872\t      - '0.15'\n873\t      - '1338'\n874\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n875\t      - '0.15'\n876\t      - '[0.01, 0.38]'\n877\t      - '0.11'\n878\t      - '1311'\n879\t    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n880\t      - '0.09'\n881\t      - '[0.00, 0.28]'\n882\t      - '0.07'\n883\t      - '1285'\n884\t  - name: theta_bias_by_cn_group\n885\t    caption: Mean θ̂ overestimation by c_n group (Stage 1 MFRM vs Stage 3 G-MFRM)\n886\t    columns:\n887\t    - c_n Group\n888\t    - N\n889\t    - Mean c_n\n890\t    - Mean theta bias\n891\t    - Std theta bias\n892\t    rows:\n893\t    - - Low (c_n < 0.25)\n894\t      - '6'\n895\t      - '0.12'\n896\t      - '0.03'\n897\t      - '0.04'\n898\t    - - Medium (0.25-0.75)\n899\t      - '10'\n900\t      - '0.48'\n901\t      - '0.11'\n902\t      - '0.07'\n903\t    - - High (c_n > 0.75)\n904\t      - '6'\n905\t      - '1.08'\n906\t      - '0.21'\n907\t      - '0.09'\n908\t  figures_description:\n909\t  - 'c_n vs ConStat delta scatter: 22 points, x = G-MFRM c_n, y = ConStat per-model\n910\t    delta. Pearson r = 0.52 (95% CI [0.14, 0.77]). Regression line with prediction\n911\t    interval. Points colored by model family.'\n912\t  - 'c_n posterior violin plots: 22 violins sorted by posterior mean. Half-Cauchy\n913\t    prior shape visible in near-zero models. Top 4 models clearly separated from the\n914\t    rest.'\n915\t  - 'θ-bias scatter: x = c_n, y = Δθ̂ (MFRM minus G-MFRM). Positive relationship (r\n916\t    = 0.35) confirms high-c_n models are systematically overestimated by MFRM. Horizontal\n917\t    band at Δθ = 0 for low-c_n models.'\n918\t  analysis: '实验确认 Tier B 叙事。真实污染处于 weak-to-moderate 水平，大多数模型 c_n < 0.8。 ConStat 外部验证\n919\t    r = 0.52 支持 c_n 的构念效度。θ-bias 分析为 Claim 1 提供了 方向性证据——confounding 存在且可检测，但实际影响对\n920\t    68% 的模型而言很小。 论文叙事应聚焦 top-quartile 模型（c_n > 0.75）的修正价值，同时将 per-model c_n 本身（作为\n921\t    training data audit 工具）提升为 co-primary contribution。 Qwen3-235B-A22B 的 c_n = 1.42\n922\t    是最显著案例——将在论文中作为 case study 展示。\n923\t\n924\t    '\n925\t- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n926\t  plan_id: exp-006\n927\t  description: 'Sensitivity analysis: vary judge count (2, 4, 6, 8) and measure G-MFRM\n928\t    performance. Include leave-one-judge-out preference leakage diagnostic.\n929\t\n930\t    '\n931\t  expected_results:\n932\t    tau_8_judges: 0.823\n933\t    tau_6_judges: 0.812\n934\t    tau_4_judges: 0.791\n935\t    tau_2_judges: 0.768\n936\t    tau_mfrm_8_judges: 0.794\n937\t    tau_mfrm_4_judges: 0.779\n938\t    tau_mfrm_2_judges: 0.765\n939\t    min_judges_gmfrm_gt_mfrm: 4\n940\t    rhat_8_judges: 1.06\n941\t    rhat_6_judges: 1.07\n942\t    rhat_4_judges: 1.09\n943\t    rhat_2_judges: 1.18\n944\t    ess_8_judges: 132\n945\t    ess_6_judges: 108\n946\t    ess_4_judges: 84\n947\t    ess_2_judges: 41\n948\t    cn_rmse_8_judges: 0.39\n949\t    cn_rmse_4_judges: 0.58\n950\t    cn_rmse_2_judges: 1.21\n951\t    max_residual_shift_same_family: 0.14\n952\t    max_residual_shift_cross_family: 0.06\n953\t    preference_leakage_detected_pairs: 2\n954\t    preference_leakage_models: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (judged by Claude Opus 4.7), Qwen3.6-27B\n955\t      (judged by Qwen3-235B-A22B)\n956\t  result_rationale: 'Judge count sensitivity 在 median 档下呈现明确的阈值行为： (1) 2 judges 时\n957\t    G-MFRM 退化至 MFRM 水平——c_n 和 d_j 信号无法分离（R̂=1.18, ESS=41 表明 c_n 参数未收敛），验证了论文预期的 graceful\n958\t    degradation； (2) 4 judges 是 G-MFRM 开始稳定超越 MFRM 的最小配置（Δτ ≈ 0.012，ESS=84 勉强可接受）；\n959\t    (3) 6→8 judges 的边际提升递减（Δτ = 0.011），说明 8 judges 接近饱和。 Leave-one-judge-out 检测到 2\n960\t    个 preference leakage 对：同家族 judge 评价同家族模型时 残差系统性偏移 ≈ 0.14 logits。这低于 d_j 的典型范围（1.74\n961\t    logits）， 但足以在论文中报告为 \"detectable but not dominant\"。Median 档下 leakage 效应 不足以要求 f_{nj}\n962\t    交互项（添加会导致过参数化），但应在 Limitations 中讨论。\n963\t\n964\t    '\n965\t  tables:\n966\t  - name: judge_count_curve\n967\t    caption: G-MFRM performance by number of judges\n968\t    columns:\n969\t    - N Judges\n970\t    - tau G-MFRM\n971\t    - tau MFRM\n972\t    - Delta\n973\t    - R-hat max\n974\t    - ESS min\n975\t    - c_n RMSE\n976\t    rows:\n977\t    - - '2'\n978\t      - '0.768'\n979\t      - '0.765'\n980\t      - '+0.003'\n981\t      - '1.18'\n982\t      - '41'\n983\t      - '1.21'\n984\t    - - '4'\n985\t      - '0.791'\n986\t      - '0.779'\n987\t      - '+0.012'\n988\t      - '1.09'\n989\t      - '84'\n990\t      - '0.58'\n991\t    - - '6'\n992\t      - '0.812'\n993\t      - '0.789'\n994\t      - '+0.023'\n995\t      - '1.07'\n996\t      - '108'\n997\t      - '0.46'\n998\t    - - '8'\n999\t      - '0.823'\n1000\t      - '0.794'\n1001\t      - '+0.029'\n1002\t      - '1.06'\n1003\t      - '132'\n1004\t      - '0.39'\n1005\t  - name: leakage_diagnostic\n1006\t    caption: Leave-one-judge-out residual analysis for preference leakage\n1007\t    columns:\n1008\t    - Removed Judge\n1009\t    - Most Affected Model\n1010\t    - Residual Shift\n1011\t    - Same Family?\n1012\t    - Significant?\n1013\t    rows:\n1014\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n1015\t      - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n1016\t      - '-0.14'\n1017\t      - 'Yes'\n1018\t      - Yes (p=0.032)\n1019\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n1020\t      - Qwen3.6-27B\n1021\t      - '-0.11'\n1022\t      - 'Yes'\n1023\t      - Yes (p=0.048)\n1024\t    - - GPT-5.5\n1025\t      - GPT-4.5\n1026\t      - '-0.08'\n1027\t      - 'Yes'\n1028\t      - No (p=0.127)\n1029\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n1030\t      - DeepSeek-V3-Base\n1031\t      - '+0.06'\n1032\t      - 'Yes'\n1033\t      - No (p=0.312)\n1034\t    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n1035\t      - Gemini-2.0-Flash\n1036\t      - '-0.05'\n1037\t      - 'Yes'\n1038\t      - No (p=0.389)\n1039\t  figures_description:\n1040\t  - 'Judge count sensitivity curve: x = N judges, y = Kendall τ. Two lines (G-MFRM,\n1041\t    MFRM). G-MFRM curve above MFRM for N ≥ 4, converging at N = 2. Shaded region shows\n1042\t    95% CI from judge subset bootstrap.'\n1043\t  - 'Convergence diagnostic by judge count: 2-panel. Left: R̂ max vs N judges (threshold\n1044\t    line at 1.10). Right: ESS min vs N judges (threshold line at 100). Both show clear\n1045\t    improvement with more judges.'\n1046\t  - 'Leave-one-judge-out residual heatmap: rows = judges removed, columns = models.\n1047\t    Color intensity = residual shift magnitude. Same-family cells highlighted with\n1048\t    border. Two significant cells visible.'\n1049\t  analysis: '4 judges 是 G-MFRM 实用性的最低配置。论文应建议 6+ judges 作为推荐配置， 并明确说明 2 judges 时 G-MFRM\n1050\t    自动退化为 MFRM（功能降级而非失败）。 Preference leakage 在 2/5 个同家族对中显著但效应量小， 支持 \"detectable but\n1051\t    absorbed into θ̂ uniformly\" 的论文立场。\n1052\t\n1053\t    '\n1054\t- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n1055\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1056\t  description: 'Ablation study: contribution of each e_i source to final pipeline\n1057\t    quality. Leave-one-out analysis on e_i estimation and downstream θ̂ accuracy.\n1058\t\n1059\t    '\n1060\t  expected_results:\n1061\t    full_pipeline_ei_consistency: 0.43\n1062\t    full_pipeline_theta_tau: 0.823\n1063\t    full_pipeline_cn_constat_r: 0.52\n1064\t    without_performance_gap_tau: 0.786\n1065\t    without_temporal_tau: 0.818\n1066\t    without_logprober_tau: 0.812\n1067\t    without_performance_gap_cn_r: 0.31\n1068\t    without_temporal_cn_r: 0.49\n1069\t    without_logprober_cn_r: 0.44\n1070\t    only_performance_gap_tau: 0.814\n1071\t    only_temporal_tau: 0.788\n1072\t    only_logprober_tau: 0.795\n1073\t    optimal_weight_gap: 0.62\n1074\t    optimal_weight_temporal: 0.18\n1075\t    optimal_weight_logprober: 0.2\n1076\t    weight_sensitivity_tau_range:\n1077\t    - 0.81\n1078\t    - 0.825\n1079\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 e_i pipeline 的三个 source 贡献不对称：performance gap 是主要信号源，\n1080\t    移除后 τ 下降最大（0.823→0.786），因为它直接测量 \"original vs rephrased\" 的分数差—— 最接近 contamination\n1081\t    的操作性定义。Temporal signal 贡献最弱（移除后 τ 仅降 0.005）， 因为其覆盖率仅 41% 且许多 item 的时间切分不精确。LogProber\n1082\t    居中——它捕获 verbatim 记忆（与 performance gap 的 \"能力增益\" 部分互补），但受限于 API 模型可用性。 性能对权重组合不太敏感（τ\n1083\t    在 [0.810, 0.825] 范围内），说明三个 source 的信号 方向一致但噪声不同。单独使用 performance gap 已能达到总效果的\n1084\t    ~80%—— 这简化了实际部署：practitioners 只需构建 reference variants，不必部署 LogProber。\n1085\t\n1086\t    '\n1087\t  tables:\n1088\t  - name: ablation_results\n1089\t    caption: 'e_i source ablation: impact on downstream G-MFRM performance'\n1090\t    columns:\n1091\t    - Configuration\n1092\t    - N Sources\n1093\t    - tau (Arena)\n1094\t    - c_n-ConStat r\n1095\t    - Delta tau vs Full\n1096\t    rows:\n1097\t    - - Full Pipeline\n1098\t      - '3'\n1099\t      - '0.823'\n1100\t      - '0.52'\n1101\t      - —\n1102\t    - - w/o Performance Gap\n1103\t      - '2'\n1104\t      - '0.786'\n1105\t      - '0.31'\n1106\t      - '-0.037'\n1107\t    - - w/o Temporal Signal\n1108\t      - '2'\n1109\t      - '0.818'\n1110\t      - '0.49'\n1111\t      - '-0.005'\n1112\t    - - w/o LogProber\n1113\t      - '2'\n1114\t      - '0.812'\n1115\t      - '0.44'\n1116\t      - '-0.011'\n1117\t    - - Only Performance Gap\n1118\t      - '1'\n1119\t      - '0.814'\n1120\t      - '0.46'\n1121\t      - '-0.009'\n1122\t    - - Only Temporal\n1123\t      - '1'\n1124\t      - '0.788'\n1125\t      - '0.33'\n1126\t      - '-0.035'\n1127\t    - - Only LogProber\n1128\t      - '1'\n1129\t      - '0.795'\n1130\t      - '0.38'\n1131\t      - '-0.028'\n1132\t    - - MFRM (no e_i)\n1133\t      - '0'\n1134\t      - '0.794'\n1135\t      - —\n1136\t      - '-0.029'\n1137\t  figures_description:\n1138\t  - 'Ablation bar chart: 7 configurations, y = Kendall τ. Horizontal dashed line at\n1139\t    full pipeline (0.823) and MFRM baseline (0.794). Error bars from 5-fold CV on\n1140\t    e_i weight optimization.'\n1141\t  - 'Source contribution Venn diagram: three overlapping circles (Gap, Temporal, LogProber)\n1142\t    with unique and shared variance proportions. Gap has largest unique contribution\n1143\t    (~45%), shared region (~20%).'\n1144\t  analysis: 'Performance gap 是 e_i pipeline 的核心，其他 source 提供增量但非必须。 论文应将 full pipeline\n1145\t    作为主要报告，但在 practical recommendations 中 指出单源（performance gap only）是可行的简化方案，τ 损失仅\n1146\t    0.009。 这增强了方法的实际可部署性。\n1147\t\n1148\t    '\n1149\t- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n1150\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1151\t  description: 'Measurement quality validation: infit/outfit, person-fit statistics,\n1152\t    posterior predictive checks, divergent transitions, trace plots.\n1153\t\n1154\t    '\n1155\t  expected_results:\n1156\t    theta_infit_range:\n1157\t    - 0.82\n1158\t    - 1.28\n1159\t    theta_outfit_range:\n1160\t    - 0.78\n1161\t    - 1.35\n1162\t    theta_misfit_count: 2\n1163\t    b_infit_range:\n1164\t    - 0.71\n1165\t    - 1.42\n1166\t    b_outfit_range:\n1167\t    - 0.65\n1168\t    - 1.58\n1169\t    b_misfit_count: 38\n1170\t    b_misfit_fraction: 0.058\n1171\t    d_infit_range:\n1172\t    - 0.94\n1173\t    - 1.21\n1174\t    d_outfit_range:\n1175\t    - 0.88\n1176\t    - 1.31\n1177\t    d_misfit_count: 1\n1178\t    lz_cn_pearson_r: 0.41\n1179\t    lz_cn_spearman_rho: 0.45\n1180\t    emri_cn_pearson_r: 0.38\n1181\t    ppc_mean_residual: 0.02\n1182\t    ppc_residual_std: 0.31\n1183\t    ppc_outlier_fraction: 0.047\n1184\t    divergent_transitions_total: 14\n1185\t    divergent_transitions_fraction: 0.0007\n1186\t    max_treedepth_fraction: 0.032\n1187\t    p_waic: 187\n1188\t    waic_gmfrm: -42381\n1189\t    waic_mfrm: -41892\n1190\t    delta_waic: -489\n1191\t    delta_waic_se: 124\n1192\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 facet fit 总体可接受但有局部问题： (1) 38 个 item（5.8%）misfit，主要是\n1193\t    Arena-Hard 的 coding 题（这些题评分分布 高度双峰——要么完全正确要么完全错误，不符合 Rasch 的连续性假设）； (2) 2 个 model\n1194\t    misfit（infit > 1.28），likely 因其能力 profile 在不同 item 类别间 高度不一致（如某模型 coding 极强但 humanities\n1195\t    极弱），违反 unidimensionality； (3) lz-c_n 相关 r = 0.41 表明 person-fit 异常部分（但非全部）可被 contamination\n1196\t    解释—— 这支持 c_n 作为独立参数的必要性，而非仅靠 misfit detection 替代； (4) ΔWAIC = -489 ± 124 支持 G-MFRM\n1197\t    优于 MFRM 的模型选择，即使排名改善 modest； (5) Divergent transitions 0.07% 在可接受范围内，主要集中在 near-zero\n1198\t    c_n 模型 （Half-Cauchy prior 在零附近的梯度问题），不影响整体推断。\n1199\t\n1200\t    '\n1201\t  tables:\n1202\t  - name: fit_statistics_summary\n1203\t    caption: Facet fit statistics summary\n1204\t    columns:\n1205\t    - Facet\n1206\t    - N\n1207\t    - Infit MNSQ Range\n1208\t    - Outfit MNSQ Range\n1209\t    - Misfit Count\n1210\t    - Misfit Fraction\n1211\t    rows:\n1212\t    - - Model (theta)\n1213\t      - '22'\n1214\t      - '[0.82, 1.28]'\n1215\t      - '[0.78, 1.35]'\n1216\t      - '2'\n1217\t      - '0.091'\n1218\t    - - Item (b)\n1219\t      - '660'\n1220\t      - '[0.71, 1.42]'\n1221\t      - '[0.65, 1.58]'\n1222\t      - '38'\n1223\t      - '0.058'\n1224\t    - - Judge (d)\n1225\t      - '8'\n1226\t      - '[0.94, 1.21]'\n1227\t      - '[0.88, 1.31]'\n1228\t      - '1'\n1229\t      - '0.125'\n1230\t    - - Contamination (c)\n1231\t      - '22'\n1232\t      - —\n1233\t      - —\n1234\t      - —\n1235\t      - —\n1236\t  - name: personfit_vs_cn\n1237\t    caption: Person-fit statistic correlation with contamination estimate\n1238\t    columns:\n1239\t    - Person-fit Statistic\n1240\t    - Correlation with c_n\n1241\t    - p-value\n1242\t    - Interpretation\n1243\t    rows:\n1244\t    - - lz (standardized)\n1245\t      - '0.41'\n1246\t      - '0.058'\n1247\t      - Moderate; c_n captures part of lz signal\n1248\t    - - EMRi\n1249\t      - '0.38'\n1250\t      - '0.081'\n1251\t      - Moderate; similar to lz\n1252\t    - - Infit MNSQ\n1253\t      - '0.29'\n1254\t      - '0.192'\n1255\t      - Weak; misfit not solely from contamination\n1256\t  - name: model_comparison_waic\n1257\t    caption: Model comparison via WAIC\n1258\t    columns:\n1259\t    - Model\n1260\t    - WAIC\n1261\t    - p_WAIC\n1262\t    - Delta WAIC\n1263\t    - SE(Delta)\n1264\t    rows:\n1265\t    - - G-MFRM (Stage 3)\n1266\t      - '-42381'\n1267\t      - '187'\n1268\t      - —\n1269\t      - —\n1270\t    - - MFRM (Stage 1)\n1271\t      - '-41892'\n1272\t      - '142'\n1273\t      - '+489'\n1274\t      - '124'\n1275\t    - - Raw IRT (no facets)\n1276\t      - '-39847'\n1277\t      - '68'\n1278\t      - '+2534'\n1279\t      - '312'\n1280\t  figures_description:\n1281\t  - 'Infit/outfit bubble chart: x = infit, y = outfit, bubble size = c_n. Rectangle\n1282\t    shows acceptable range [0.70, 1.30]. Misfitting items labeled. High-c_n models\n1283\t    tend toward upper-right (overfit pattern).'\n1284\t  - 'Posterior predictive check: observed vs predicted score distribution, overlaid.\n1285\t    4 panels for different model ability quartiles. Fit is good for mid-range models,\n1286\t    slight underprediction at extremes.'\n1287\t  - 'Trace plots: 4 × 4 grid showing θ_1, d_1, c_1, b_1 traces across 4 chains. Visual\n1288\t    mixing adequate for θ and d; mild autocorrelation in c_n (ESS lower); b well-mixed.'\n1289\t  - 'lz vs c_n scatter: x = c_n, y = lz statistic. Moderate positive trend (r = 0.41).\n1290\t    Points above lz = 2 threshold labeled. Not all high-c_n models are high-lz, confirming\n1291\t    c_n captures distinct signal.'\n1292\t  analysis: 'Diagnostics 支持 G-MFRM 的测量质量，但需在论文中报告 misfitting items 和 convergence 细节。WAIC\n1293\t    比较提供了统计层面的模型选择证据（ΔW = -489 ± 124， 约 4σ 显著），即使 τ 改善 modest。lz-c_n 的中等相关是叙事亮点： 传统\n1294\t    person-fit 能检测 \"something wrong\" 但不能归因；G-MFRM 的 c_n 提供 可解释的归因——\"this model''s\n1295\t    anomalous response pattern is partly explained by contamination susceptibility\"。这直接支持\n1296\t    diagnostics-as-co-primary 叙事。\n1297\t\n1298\t    '\n1299\t- name: confounding_formal_observation\n1300\t  plan_id: exp-009\n1301\t  description: 'Formal OVB bias derivation + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n\n1302\t    point-estimate validation.\n1303\t\n1304\t    '\n1305\t  expected_results:\n1306\t    bias_formula_derived: true\n1307\t    bias_direction_prediction: overestimation when Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i) > 0\n1308\t    bias_magnitude_first_order: β_OVB ≈ Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i) / Var(d_j)\n1309\t    mc_replications: 1000\n1310\t    mc_bias_direction_correct_fraction: 0.91\n1311\t    mc_bias_magnitude_rmse: 0.08\n1312\t    mc_sequential_bias_first_theta_bias: 0.13\n1313\t    mc_sequential_contam_first_theta_bias: 0.11\n1314\t    mc_joint_theta_bias: 0.02\n1315\t    mc_joint_theta_rmse: 0.13\n1316\t    mc_sequential_theta_rmse: 0.19\n1317\t    mc_rmse_reduction: 0.316\n1318\t    confounding_scatter_r: 0.35\n1319\t    confounding_scatter_p: 0.002\n1320\t    cn_point_rmse: 0.44\n1321\t    cn_95ci_coverage: 0.88\n1322\t    cn_corr_with_true: 0.82\n1323\t    cn_mean_bias: 0.06\n1324\t    rho_sweep_values:\n1325\t    - 0.0\n1326\t    - 0.15\n1327\t    - 0.3\n1328\t    - 0.45\n1329\t    - 0.6\n1330\t    bias_at_rho_0: 0.01\n1331\t    bias_at_rho_0_15: 0.05\n1332\t    bias_at_rho_0_30: 0.1\n1333\t    bias_at_rho_0_45: 0.15\n1334\t    bias_at_rho_0_60: 0.21\n1335\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Monte Carlo 验证了 OVB 机制但效应量 moderate： (1) Bias direction\n1336\t    正确率 91%（非 100% 因为有限样本噪声在低 ρ 时可逆转方向）； (2) Sequential bias ≈ 0.11-0.13 logits，处于\n1337\t    \"≤ 0.15 for most models\" 的范围内； (3) Joint estimation 大幅降低 bias 至 0.02（接近无偏），RMSE\n1338\t    降低 31.6%， 但这是在受控合成数据上——真实数据效果会因 e_i 噪声而打折； (4) Confounding scatter r = 0.35 处于\n1339\t    [0.25, 0.45] 中部，低于 mvp_002/003 的 r = 0.65（后者是强污染下的结果），反映 median 档下信号较弱； (5) c_n\n1340\t    点估计回收 RMSE = 0.44，95% CI 覆盖率 88%——略低于 nominal 95%， 说明 posterior 有轻微欠覆盖（Half-Cauchy\n1341\t    prior 在高 c_n 值时约束过强）， 但对 c_n 排序而言足够（corr = 0.82）。 ρ sweep 清楚展示了 bias 随 confounding\n1342\t    强度单调递增，为 Section 2 的 \"Observation\" 提供了直观的教学图表。\n1343\t\n1344\t    '\n1345\t  tables:\n1346\t  - name: monte_carlo_bias_summary\n1347\t    caption: Monte Carlo bias validation (1000 replications, ρ = 0.30)\n1348\t    columns:\n1349\t    - Estimator\n1350\t    - Mean theta bias\n1351\t    - Theta RMSE\n1352\t    - RMSE vs Joint\n1353\t    rows:\n1354\t    - - Joint G-MFRM\n1355\t      - '0.02'\n1356\t      - '0.13'\n1357\t      - —\n1358\t    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n1359\t      - '0.13'\n1360\t      - '0.19'\n1361\t      - +46.2%\n1362\t    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n1363\t      - '0.11'\n1364\t      - '0.18'\n1365\t      - +38.5%\n1366\t    - - MFRM-only (ignore c)\n1367\t      - '0.14'\n1368\t      - '0.20'\n1369\t      - +53.8%\n1370\t    - - Raw average\n1371\t      - '0.31'\n1372\t      - '0.38'\n1373\t      - +192.3%\n1374\t  - name: rho_sweep\n1375\t    caption: Sequential estimator bias as function of confounding strength ρ\n1376\t    columns:\n1377\t    - rho(d,ce)\n1378\t    - Sequential Bias\n1379\t    - Joint Bias\n1380\t    - Bias Ratio\n1381\t    rows:\n1382\t    - - '0.00'\n1383\t      - '0.01'\n1384\t      - '0.01'\n1385\t      - '1.0'\n1386\t    - - '0.15'\n1387\t      - '0.05'\n1388\t      - '0.01'\n1389\t      - '5.0'\n1390\t    - - '0.30'\n1391\t      - '0.10'\n1392\t      - '0.02'\n1393\t      - '5.0'\n1394\t    - - '0.45'\n1395\t      - '0.15'\n1396\t      - '0.02'\n1397\t      - '7.5'\n1398\t    - - '0.60'\n1399\t      - '0.21'\n1400\t      - '0.03'\n1401\t      - '7.0'\n1402\t  - name: cn_recovery\n1403\t    caption: Synthetic c_n recovery statistics\n1404\t    columns:\n1405\t    - Metric\n1406\t    - Value\n1407\t    - Acceptable Threshold\n1408\t    rows:\n1409\t    - - Point RMSE\n1410\t      - '0.44'\n1411\t      - < 0.60\n1412\t    - - 95% CI Coverage\n1413\t      - '0.88'\n1414\t      - '> 0.90 (marginal)'\n1415\t    - - Correlation with true c_n\n1416\t      - '0.82'\n1417\t      - '> 0.70'\n1418\t    - - Mean bias\n1419\t      - '+0.06'\n1420\t      - < 0.10\n1421\t  figures_description:\n1422\t  - 'Bias vs ρ curve: x = ρ(d, c·e), y = mean θ̂ bias. Two lines (sequential, joint).\n1423\t    Sequential rises linearly; joint stays near zero. Shaded bands show MC 95% intervals.\n1424\t    This is the key Section 2 figure.'\n1425\t  - 'Confounding scatter: x = true θ - θ̂_sequential, y = c_n. Positive correlation\n1426\t    (r = 0.35). High-c_n models are overestimated by sequential. Regression line with\n1427\t    95% CI.'\n1428\t  - 'c_n recovery: x = true c_n, y = estimated c_n. Identity line. 95% CI whiskers\n1429\t    per point. Most points near identity but with scatter (RMSE = 0.44). Coverage\n1430\t    slightly below nominal at high c_n values.'\n1431\t  analysis: 'OVB Observation 在合成数据上得到清晰验证。ρ sweep 图是 Section 2 的核心—— 直观展示 confounding\n1432\t    如何随 ρ 增长导致 sequential bias 线性增长，而 joint estimation 保持无偏。c_n 回收的 88% coverage 需在\n1433\t    Limitations 中提及—— posterior 在高 c_n 处略偏窄，可能因 Half-Cauchy 先验的约束效应。 Confounding scatter\n1434\t    r = 0.35 足以支持 \"mechanism exists\"（Claim 1）的 median 档表述。\n1435\t\n1436\t    '\n1437\t- name: wildbench_replication\n1438\t  plan_id: exp-010\n1439\t  description: 'Replicate G-MFRM pipeline on WildBench as third benchmark for cross-benchmark\n1440\t    generalization.\n1441\t\n1442\t    '\n1443\t  expected_results:\n1444\t    wildbench_items: 1024\n1445\t    wildbench_judges_used: 6\n1446\t    wildbench_models_evaluated: 18\n1447\t    wildbench_tau_gmfrm: 0.808\n1448\t    wildbench_tau_mfrm: 0.786\n1449\t    wildbench_tau_raw: 0.749\n1450\t    wildbench_tau_uda: 0.793\n1451\t    wildbench_delta_tau_vs_uda: 0.015\n1452\t    wildbench_delta_p: 0.094\n1453\t    wildbench_cn_median: 0.38\n1454\t    wildbench_cn_correlation_with_mtbench_cn: 0.71\n1455\t    wildbench_rhat_max: 1.08\n1456\t    wildbench_ess_min: 96\n1457\t    wildbench_runtime_seconds: 11240\n1458\t    wildbench_ei_mean: 0.26\n1459\t    wildbench_ei_internal_consistency: 0.37\n1460\t  result_rationale: 'WildBench 的 c_n 中位数（0.38）低于 MT-Bench+Arena-Hard（0.48），因为 WildBench\n1461\t    发布较晚、item 更多样且更接近真实用户 query（更难被训练数据直接覆盖）。 这进一步压缩了 G-MFRM 的排名改善空间（Δτ = 0.015 vs\n1462\t    UDA，p = 0.094 不显著）。 但跨 benchmark 的 c_n 一致性高（r = 0.71）——同一模型在不同 benchmark 上的 contamination\n1463\t    susceptibility 相关，支持 c_n 作为 \"model-level trait\" 的构念效度。 收敛性比主实验略差（R̂=1.08, ESS=96），可能因\n1464\t    6 judges（而非 8）降低了信息量。 e_i 内部一致性更低（0.37 vs 0.43），因为 WildBench 的 item 更长更复杂， reference\n1465\t    variant 构建质量下降。这是跨 benchmark 泛化的实际成本。\n1466\t\n1467\t    '\n1468\t  tables:\n1469\t  - name: cross_benchmark_comparison\n1470\t    caption: G-MFRM performance across benchmarks\n1471\t    columns:\n1472\t    - Benchmark\n1473\t    - N Items\n1474\t    - N Judges\n1475\t    - tau G-MFRM\n1476\t    - tau UDA\n1477\t    - Delta tau\n1478\t    - p-value\n1479\t    - c_n median\n1480\t    rows:\n1481\t    - - MT-Bench\n1482\t      - '160'\n1483\t      - '8'\n1484\t      - '0.811'\n1485\t      - '0.798'\n1486\t      - '+0.013'\n1487\t      - '0.112'\n1488\t      - '0.55'\n1489\t    - - Arena-Hard\n1490\t      - '500'\n1491\t      - '8'\n1492\t      - '0.831'\n1493\t      - '0.812'\n1494\t      - '+0.019'\n1495\t      - '0.054'\n1496\t      - '0.44'\n1497\t    - - WildBench\n1498\t      - '1024'\n1499\t      - '6'\n1500\t      - '0.808'\n1501\t      - '0.793'\n1502\t      - '+0.015'\n1503\t      - '0.094'\n1504\t      - '0.38'\n1505\t    - - Combined (MT+AH)\n1506\t      - '660'\n1507\t      - '8'\n1508\t      - '0.823'\n1509\t      - '0.805'\n1510\t      - '+0.018'\n1511\t      - '0.067'\n1512\t      - '0.48'\n1513\t  - name: cn_cross_benchmark\n1514\t    caption: Cross-benchmark c_n consistency (Pearson correlation)\n1515\t    columns:\n1516\t    - Benchmark Pair\n1517\t    - Shared Models\n1518\t    - c_n Correlation\n1519\t    - p-value\n1520\t    rows:\n1521\t    - - MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard\n1522\t      - '22'\n1523\t      - '0.78'\n1524\t      - < 0.001\n1525\t    - - MT-Bench vs WildBench\n1526\t      - '18'\n1527\t      - '0.68'\n1528\t      - '0.002'\n1529\t    - - Arena-Hard vs WildBench\n1530\t      - '18'\n1531\t      - '0.74'\n1532\t      - < 0.001\n1533\t    - - (MT+AH) vs WildBench\n1534\t      - '18'\n1535\t      - '0.71'\n1536\t      - '0.001'\n1537\t  figures_description:\n1538\t  - 'Cross-benchmark c_n scatter: 3 panels (MT vs AH, MT vs WB, AH vs WB). Each panel\n1539\t    shows per-model c_n on x and y axes. Strong positive correlations confirm c_n\n1540\t    is a stable model-level property across benchmarks.'\n1541\t  - 'Per-benchmark Δτ forest plot: 3 rows (MT-Bench, Arena-Hard, WildBench) showing\n1542\t    Δτ ± 95% CI. All positive, all overlap zero at lower bound. Pooled estimate shown\n1543\t    at bottom.'\n1544\t  analysis: 'WildBench 复制确认了 G-MFRM 的跨 benchmark 泛化性，但效应量更小（lower contamination）。\n1545\t    核心价值在于 c_n 跨 benchmark 一致性（r = 0.68-0.78）——证明 contamination susceptibility 是 model-level\n1546\t    trait 而非 benchmark artifact。 论文应将此作为 c_n 构念效度的额外证据，而非第三个独立的排名改善论证。\n1547\t\n1548\t    '\n1549\t- name: adversarial_robustness\n1550\t  plan_id: exp-011\n1551\t  description: 'Test G-MFRM robustness against adversarial contamination following\n1552\t    Wang et al. (ICLR 2026).\n1553\t\n1554\t    '\n1555\t  expected_results:\n1556\t    adversarial_types_tested: 3\n1557\t    adversarial_models_injected: 4\n1558\t    cn_detection_auc_mild: 0.78\n1559\t    cn_detection_auc_moderate: 0.84\n1560\t    cn_detection_auc_severe: 0.91\n1561\t    theta_rank_corruption_without_gmfrm: 3.2\n1562\t    theta_rank_corruption_with_gmfrm: 1.1\n1563\t    rank_protection_rate: 0.66\n1564\t    undetectable_adversarial_fraction: 0.22\n1565\t    failure_mode: Adversarial contamination that mimics genuine ability gain (uniform\n1566\t      across items) is undetectable by rank-1 c·e gating\n1567\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 的防御是 partial： (1)\n1568\t    Severe contamination（大幅度、item-specific 的性能膨胀）被 c_n 可靠检测（AUC=0.91）， 因为 rank-1 c·e\n1569\t    结构能捕获 item-specific 膨胀模式； (2) Mild contamination（小幅度、接近均匀的膨胀）检测 AUC 降至 0.78，因为均匀膨胀\n1570\t    与真实能力提升难以区分——这是 rank-1 假设的根本限制； (3) 22% 的 adversarial 模式完全不可检测——特别是\"能力伪装型\"污染 （在所有\n1571\t    item 上均匀小幅提升），被吸收进 θ̂ 而非 c_n。 Rank protection rate 0.66 表明 G-MFRM 缓解了约 2/3 的排名腐蚀，\n1572\t    但不是完全防御。论文应在 Limitations 中坦诚讨论这一边界。\n1573\t\n1574\t    '\n1575\t  tables:\n1576\t  - name: adversarial_detection\n1577\t    caption: G-MFRM adversarial contamination detection performance\n1578\t    columns:\n1579\t    - Adversarial Type\n1580\t    - Severity\n1581\t    - c_n AUC\n1582\t    - Rank Corruption w/o G-MFRM\n1583\t    - Rank Corruption w/ G-MFRM\n1584\t    rows:\n1585\t    - - Data Poisoning\n1586\t      - Mild\n1587\t      - '0.76'\n1588\t      - '1.8'\n1589\t      - '0.9'\n1590\t    - - Data Poisoning\n1591\t      - Severe\n1592\t      - '0.92'\n1593\t      - '4.1'\n1594\t      - '1.2'\n1595\t    - - Prompt Injection\n1596\t      - Mild\n1597\t      - '0.74'\n1598\t      - '1.5'\n1599\t      - '0.8'\n1600\t    - - Prompt Injection\n1601\t      - Severe\n1602\t      - '0.88'\n1603\t      - '3.8'\n1604\t      - '1.4'\n1605\t    - - Benchmark Memorization\n1606\t      - Mild\n1607\t      - '0.83'\n1608\t      - '2.1'\n1609\t      - '0.7'\n1610\t    - - Benchmark Memorization\n1611\t      - Severe\n1612\t      - '0.93'\n1613\t      - '4.5'\n1614\t      - '0.9'\n1615\t  figures_description:\n1616\t  - 'Adversarial ROC curves: 3 panels (one per adversarial type), each with mild/moderate/severe\n1617\t    severity curves. AUC annotated. All above chance; severe curves approach upper-left.'\n1618\t  - 'Rank corruption bar chart: paired bars (without G-MFRM, with G-MFRM) for each\n1619\t    adversarial condition. Clear reduction in all conditions but residual corruption\n1620\t    persists.'\n1621\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM 提供了 meaningful 但非完美的 adversarial 防御。论文应定位为 \"G-MFRM detects and\n1622\t    mitigates item-specific contamination patterns (rank-1 structure); uniform adversarial\n1623\t    inflation remains a fundamental detection limit shared by all item-level analysis\n1624\t    methods.\" Rank-k 扩展作为 future work 指向。\n1625\t\n1626\t    '\n1627\t- name: error_propagation_sensitivity\n1628\t  plan_id: exp-012\n1629\t  description: 'Sensitivity analysis for staged estimation: inject Gaussian noise\n1630\t    into e_i at σ=0.1,0.2,0.5. Measure θ̂ RMSE degradation and c_n recovery accuracy.\n1631\t\n1632\t    '\n1633\t  expected_results:\n1634\t    sigma_0_theta_rmse: 0.128\n1635\t    sigma_0_theta_tau: 0.916\n1636\t    sigma_0_cn_rmse: 0.53\n1637\t    sigma_0_cn_corr: 0.86\n1638\t    sigma_01_theta_rmse: 0.13\n1639\t    sigma_01_theta_tau: 0.915\n1640\t    sigma_01_cn_rmse: 0.55\n1641\t    sigma_01_cn_corr: 0.85\n1642\t    sigma_01_delta_theta_pct: 1.6\n1643\t    sigma_01_delta_cn_pct: 3.8\n1644\t    sigma_02_theta_rmse: 0.136\n1645\t    sigma_02_theta_tau: 0.914\n1646\t    sigma_02_cn_rmse: 0.58\n1647\t    sigma_02_cn_corr: 0.84\n1648\t    sigma_02_delta_theta_pct: 6.3\n1649\t    sigma_02_delta_cn_pct: 9.4\n1650\t    sigma_05_theta_rmse: 0.175\n1651\t    sigma_05_theta_tau: 0.885\n1652\t    sigma_05_cn_rmse: 0.84\n1653\t    sigma_05_cn_corr: 0.75\n1654\t    sigma_05_delta_theta_pct: 36.7\n1655\t    sigma_05_delta_cn_pct: 58.5\n1656\t    all_converged: true\n1657\t    rhat_max_all: 1.02\n1658\t    robust_threshold: 0.2\n1659\t    verdict: PARTIAL — robust at σ ≤ 0.2, exceeds threshold at σ = 0.5\n1660\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 e_i 的有效 σ ≈ 0.24，恰好处于 robust (σ≤0.2) 和 degraded (σ=0.5)\n1661\t    之间的过渡区。这意味着真实数据的 Stage 3 结果会经历 ~6-10% 的 θ 精度损失 （相对于 oracle e_i），但不会崩溃。关键观察：θ̂\n1662\t    对 e_i 噪声的鲁棒性优于 c_n 的 鲁棒性——σ=0.2 时 θ RMSE 仅增 6.3% 但 c_n RMSE 增 9.4%。这是因为 θ̂ 同时受\n1663\t    多个 item 的约束（聚合效应缓冲了 e_i 噪声），而 c_n 直接依赖 e_i·c_n 的乘积项， 噪声传播更直接。σ=0.5 的结果（θ degradation\n1664\t    36.7%）是上界估计——说明如果 e_i pipeline 完全失效，staged estimation 的优势将大幅削减。论文应引用此结果论证： \"Stage\n1665\t    2 e_i 估计质量是系统性能的关键瓶颈，但在当前 pipeline（σ ≈ 0.2-0.25）下 性能退化在可接受范围内。\"\n1666\t\n1667\t    '\n1668\t  tables:\n1669\t  - name: sensitivity_results\n1670\t    caption: Error propagation sensitivity analysis (20 synthetic replications per\n1671\t      σ)\n1672\t    columns:\n1673\t    - sigma_e\n1674\t    - theta RMSE\n1675\t    - theta tau\n1676\t    - c_n RMSE\n1677\t    - c_n Corr\n1678\t    - Delta theta %\n1679\t    - Delta c_n %\n1680\t    rows:\n1681\t    - - '0.0'\n1682\t      - '0.128'\n1683\t      - '0.916'\n1684\t      - '0.53'\n1685\t      - '0.86'\n1686\t      - —\n1687\t      - —\n1688\t    - - '0.1'\n1689\t      - '0.130'\n1690\t      - '0.915'\n1691\t      - '0.55'\n1692\t      - '0.85'\n1693\t      - +1.6%\n1694\t      - +3.8%\n1695\t    - - '0.2'\n1696\t      - '0.136'\n1697\t      - '0.914'\n1698\t      - '0.58'\n1699\t      - '0.84'\n1700\t      - +6.3%\n1701\t      - +9.4%\n1702\t    - - '0.5'\n1703\t      - '0.175'\n1704\t      - '0.885'\n1705\t      - '0.84'\n1706\t      - '0.75'\n1707\t      - +36.7%\n1708\t      - +58.5%\n1709\t  figures_description:\n1710\t  - 'Degradation curve: x = σ_e, y = metric value (dual axis: θ RMSE left, c_n correlation\n1711\t    right). Both degrade monotonically but θ is more robust. Vertical dashed line\n1712\t    at σ = 0.24 (estimated real e_i noise level). Shaded acceptable region.'\n1713\t  - 'Per-model c_n scatter at each σ level: 4 panels. As σ increases, scatter around\n1714\t    identity line widens. σ=0.5 panel shows severe degradation especially for small\n1715\t    c_n values (noise overwhelms signal).'\n1716\t  analysis: 已完成实验，实际结果与 median 档预测高度一致（实际 σ=0.2 时 θ RMSE +5.9%， 预测 +6.3%）。论文的关键论证：staged\n1717\t    estimation 在合理 e_i 噪声下（σ ≤ 0.2） 足够鲁棒，这使得 \"conditional joint estimation\" 成为可辩护的设计选择——\n1718\t    无需完全联合估计（under-identified）即可获得稳健结果。 σ = 0.5 的结果作为 worst-case 上界在 Limitations 中讨论。\n1719\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a3992b9-787a-424b-b229-708206b4a841","uuid":"07454f2e-4dcb-4796-8c06-d249dd30443a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T04:56:26.545Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T041217/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Reframe: joint estimation is methodologically principled AND\n  provides unique diagnostic value, even when ranking improvement is modest. Claim\n  1 softened to \"confounding exists and is detectable\" (mechanism, not magnitude).\n  Claim 3 softened to \"comparable or better rankings PLUS interpretable diagnostics\n  no baseline provides.\" Elevate per-model c_n, per-judge d_j, per-item e_i as co-primary\n  contribution. Lead with \"unified diagnostic framework\" angle. Add subset analysis:\n  show G-MFRM advantage is concentrated on high-contamination models (top quartile\n  c_n). AAAI positioning viable but needs strong writing; ARR backup advisable.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench (80 items × 2 turns)\n    and Arena-Hard (500 items) using 8 judges, evaluating 22 target models with position\n    swap.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_judges: 8\n    judge_list: GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B,\n      Qwen3.6-27B, Llama-4-Maverick, Gemini-2.5-Pro\n    total_target_models: 22\n    mt_bench_items: 160\n    arena_hard_items: 500\n    total_judgments_planned: 232320\n    total_judgments_collected: 219874\n    collection_completion_rate: 0.9464\n    api_failure_rate: 0.031\n    refusal_rate: 0.023\n    position_swap_agreement: 0.72\n    inter_judge_fleiss_kappa: 0.38\n    pairwise_judge_agreement_mean: 0.64\n    pairwise_judge_agreement_std: 0.09\n    uda_response_collection_rate: 0.98\n    api_cost_usd: 847\n    vllm_gpu_hours: 118\n    total_wall_clock_days: 11\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，数据收集本身是工程问题而非统计问题，完成率主要取决于 API 稳定性和 judge 拒答率。 95%\n    完成率符合实际 API 可用性（GPT-5.5/Claude 偶发限速，开源模型 vLLM 偶发 OOM）。 Fleiss κ ≈ 0.38 反映 LLM\n    judge 的已知分歧水平（Zheng et al. 2023 报告类似数值）， 说明 judge 间存在系统性差异——这正是 d_j 参数需要建模的信号。\n    Position swap agreement 0.72 表明位置偏差存在但不占主导，与已有文献一致。 收集 UDA 所需的 judge response\n    generation 增加约 15% 时间但不影响数据质量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: judge_coverage_matrix\n    caption: Judge × Benchmark coverage (fraction of completed evaluations)\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - MT-Bench\n    - Arena-Hard\n    - Overall\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '0.99'\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.984'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.97'\n      - '0.974'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '0.99'\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.984'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '0.97'\n      - '0.95'\n      - '0.958'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '0.96'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.942'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '0.94'\n      - '0.91'\n      - '0.922'\n    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n      - '0.95'\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.932'\n    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.96'\n      - '0.968'\n  - name: inter_judge_agreement\n    caption: Pairwise judge agreement rate (MT-Bench + Arena-Hard combined)\n    columns:\n    - Judge Pair\n    - Agreement Rate\n    - Cohen Kappa\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5 vs Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - GPT-5.5 vs DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7 vs Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '0.76'\n      - '0.51'\n    - - Proprietary mean\n      - '0.69'\n      - '0.39'\n    - - Open-source mean\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - Cross-type mean\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.32'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Judge agreement heatmap: 8×8 matrix showing pairwise Cohen κ. Proprietary judges\n    form a mild cluster (κ ≈ 0.39-0.51), open-source judges more dispersed (κ ≈ 0.22-0.35).\n    This clustering motivates modeling d_j rather than treating judges as exchangeable.'\n  - 'Position bias distribution: histogram of per-item position swap disagreement\n    rate across items. Right tail (disagreement > 0.5) concentrated in Arena-Hard\n    coding/math items, suggesting position bias is item-type dependent.'\n  analysis: '数据收集成功，覆盖率满足建模需求。关键发现：(1) 开源 judge 的覆盖率略低于 API judge， 主要因 vLLM 内存限制导致长输出截断；(2)\n    judge 间分歧显著（κ = 0.38），尤其在 主观评价维度（创造性、细致性），验证了 MFRM 对 d_j 建模的必要性； (3) 同家族 judge\n    对（如 Claude Opus vs Sonnet）agreement 更高，暗示 preference leakage 效应存在但可控。数据量足够支撑 8-facet\n    MFRM 拟合。\n\n    '\n- name: item_exposure_estimation\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 'Estimate per-item exposure e_i via three-source weighted composite\n    pipeline: performance gap (primary), temporal signal, LogProber scores.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_items_mtbench: 160\n    total_items_arenahard: 500\n    reference_variants_created: 627\n    reference_variant_quality_pass_rate: 0.87\n    performance_gap_coverage: 0.95\n    temporal_signal_coverage: 0.41\n    logprober_coverage: 0.55\n    composite_weights_performance_gap: 0.62\n    composite_weights_temporal: 0.18\n    composite_weights_logprober: 0.2\n    ei_mean: 0.34\n    ei_std: 0.22\n    ei_median: 0.29\n    ei_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.91\n    ei_internal_consistency_alpha: 0.43\n    ei_split_half_reliability: 0.39\n    ei_spearman_gap_vs_logprober: 0.48\n    ei_spearman_gap_vs_temporal: 0.36\n    ei_spearman_logprober_vs_temporal: 0.31\n    high_exposure_items_fraction: 0.18\n    near_zero_exposure_items_fraction: 0.32\n    effective_sigma_e: 0.24\n    mtbench_ei_mean: 0.42\n    arenahard_ei_mean: 0.29\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：e_i pipeline 有噪声（effective σ_e ≈ 0.2-0.3），但聚合信号有效。\n    内部一致性 α ≈ 0.43 处于 [0.3, 0.55] 范围中部，反映三个信号源测量的是相关但非同一构念： performance gap 捕获训练集泄露的综合效应，LogProber\n    捕获逐字记忆，temporal 捕获时间窗口效应。 这三者在 \"contamination\" 的广义定义下相关（r ≈ 0.3-0.5），但各自噪声源不同。\n    MT-Bench e_i 均值高于 Arena-Hard 因为 MT-Bench 发布更早、被更多训练数据包含。 约 18% 的 item 有高暴露度（e_i\n    > 0.7），集中在 MT-Bench 的经典题目（如 math/coding 常见题型） 和 Arena-Hard 的早期发布题目。32% 近零暴露主要是\n    Arena-Hard 的新增/冷门题目。 Reference variant 构建的主要瓶颈在于保持语义等价性同时改变表面形式—— 约 13% 的 item\n    因结构化输出（代码、数学公式）难以有效改写。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ei_source_statistics\n    caption: Per-source e_i estimation statistics\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - Coverage\n    - Mean e_i\n    - Std\n    - Weight\n    rows:\n    - - Performance Gap\n      - '0.95'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.62'\n    - - Temporal Signal\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - LogProber\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.26'\n      - '0.20'\n    - - Composite\n      - '1.00'\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.22'\n      - —\n  - name: ei_by_benchmark_category\n    caption: Mean e_i by benchmark and item category\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Category\n    - N Items\n    - Mean e_i\n    - Std e_i\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Writing\n      - '20'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.21'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Roleplay\n      - '20'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Reasoning\n      - '20'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Math\n      - '20'\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Coding\n      - '20'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.25'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Extraction\n      - '20'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.19'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - STEM\n      - '20'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.23'\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - Humanities\n      - '20'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.17'\n    - - Arena-Hard\n      - All\n      - '500'\n      - '0.29'\n      - '0.21'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'e_i histogram: bimodal distribution with peak near 0.1 (unexposed items) and\n    secondary mode near 0.5 (moderately exposed). Long right tail to 0.9. MT-Bench\n    items shifted right relative to Arena-Hard.'\n  - 'Source agreement scatter: 3-panel plot (gap vs logprober, gap vs temporal, logprober\n    vs temporal). Moderate positive correlations (r = 0.48, 0.36, 0.31) with substantial\n    scatter, illustrating why composite is needed.'\n  - 'Reference variant quality: scatter of original score vs reference score per item,\n    colored by e_i. High-e_i items show larger gaps (as expected). Regression line\n    with 95% CI band.'\n  analysis: 'e_i pipeline 在 median 档下表现符合预期：噪声较大但聚合后可用。关键限制是 temporal signal 覆盖率仅\n    41%（许多 item 缺乏明确时间切分点），LogProber 受限于 仅 API 模型提供 logprob。MT-Bench 的 Math/Coding/Reasoning\n    类目 e_i 最高， 符合直觉——这些是训练数据中最常见的 benchmark 题型。e_i 的有效 σ_e ≈ 0.24 将在 Stage 3 引入 c_n\n    估计噪声，但 exp-012 已证明 σ ≤ 0.2 下 θ 稳健。 这意味着 e_i 估计质量处于 exp-012 稳健性阈值的边缘，需在论文 Limitations\n    中讨论。\n\n    '\n- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'Fit G-MFRM three-stage pipeline on real data. Stage 1: MFRM. Stage\n    2: e_i from exp-002. Stage 3: Joint gated model. Compare with Chatbot Arena Kendall-τ.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    stage1_rhat_max: 1.02\n    stage1_ess_min: 412\n    stage1_runtime_seconds: 1840\n    stage1_theta_tau_arena: 0.794\n    stage3_rhat_max: 1.06\n    stage3_ess_min: 132\n    stage3_runtime_seconds: 8720\n    stage3_warmup: 3000\n    stage3_samples: 5000\n    stage3_chains: 4\n    stage3_thinning: 2\n    stage3_divergent_transitions: 14\n    theta_tau_arena_gmfrm: 0.823\n    theta_tau_arena_mfrm: 0.794\n    theta_tau_arena_raw_avg: 0.761\n    theta_spearman_arena_gmfrm: 0.857\n    theta_spearman_arena_mfrm: 0.831\n    cn_median: 0.48\n    cn_mean: 0.56\n    cn_std: 0.39\n    cn_range:\n    - 0.04\n    - 1.42\n    cn_top_quartile_mean: 1.02\n    cn_bottom_quartile_mean: 0.11\n    dj_range:\n    - -0.83\n    - 0.91\n    dj_std: 0.48\n    dj_harshest_judge: DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n    dj_most_lenient_judge: GPT-5.5\n    mtbench_tau_gmfrm: 0.811\n    mtbench_tau_mfrm: 0.783\n    arenahard_tau_gmfrm: 0.831\n    arenahard_tau_mfrm: 0.802\n    low_contam_benchmark_tau_gmfrm: 0.806\n    low_contam_benchmark_tau_mfrm: 0.801\n    graceful_degradation_pass: true\n    max_theta_shift_stage1_to_stage3: 0.34\n    models_with_shift_gt_0_2: 5\n    models_with_shift_gt_0_1: 11\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下，real c_n 分布中位数 ≈ 0.48，属于 weak-to-moderate 污染。G-MFRM\n    的 Kendall-τ = 0.823 显著优于 raw average (0.761) 但仅小幅优于 MFRM-only (0.794)， 因为 MFRM\n    本身已通过 d_j 修正了相当部分偏差。Stage 3 的边际改善来自 c_n·e_i 项对高污染模型（top quartile, c̄ ≈ 1.02）的修正——这些模型在\n    Stage 1 中 θ̂ 被 系统性高估。收敛性方面，R̂ = 1.06 和 ESS = 132 处于可接受范围但不如 mvp_003 (R̂=1.03,\n    ESS=224)，因为真实数据的模型数(22)多于合成(20)，item 数(660)远多于 合成(50)，且 e_i 携带估计噪声。需要 thinning=2\n    和延长 warmup=3000 来控制 自相关。14 个 divergent transitions 占总样本 <0.1%，在可接受范围内但需报告。 Arena-Hard\n    的 τ 高于 MT-Bench 因为 Arena-Hard item 数更多，估计更稳定。 Graceful degradation 验证通过：在低污染 benchmark\n    子集上 G-MFRM 几乎退化为 MFRM。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: three_stage_summary\n    caption: G-MFRM three-stage pipeline results on real data\n    columns:\n    - Stage\n    - Parameters\n    - R-hat max\n    - ESS min\n    - Runtime (s)\n    - Arena tau\n    rows:\n    - - Stage 1 (MFRM)\n      - theta, b, d\n      - '1.02'\n      - '412'\n      - '1840'\n      - '0.794'\n    - - Stage 2 (e_i)\n      - e_i fixed from pipeline\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Stage 3 (Joint)\n      - theta, b, d, c\n      - '1.06'\n      - '132'\n      - '8720'\n      - '0.823'\n  - name: model_ranking_top10\n    caption: Top-10 model ranking comparison (Arena Elo vs G-MFRM θ̂ vs Raw Average)\n    columns:\n    - Arena Rank\n    - Model\n    - Arena Elo\n    - G-MFRM Rank\n    - Raw Avg Rank\n    - c_n\n    - theta shift\n    rows:\n    - - '1'\n      - GPT-5.5\n      - '1347'\n      - '1'\n      - '1'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '-0.04'\n    - - '2'\n      - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '1338'\n      - '2'\n      - '3'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '-0.02'\n    - - '3'\n      - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n      - '1329'\n      - '3'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '-0.12'\n    - - '4'\n      - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '1311'\n      - '4'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '+0.01'\n    - - '5'\n      - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '1298'\n      - '6'\n      - '5'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '-0.08'\n    - - '6'\n      - Llama-4-Maverick\n      - '1285'\n      - '5'\n      - '7'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '+0.03'\n    - - '7'\n      - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '1271'\n      - '7'\n      - '4'\n      - '1.12'\n      - '-0.27'\n    - - '8'\n      - GPT-4.5\n      - '1258'\n      - '8'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '-0.15'\n    - - '9'\n      - Mistral-Large-3\n      - '1241'\n      - '9'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '-0.05'\n    - - '10'\n      - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '1224'\n      - '10'\n      - '9'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '-0.19'\n  - name: judge_severity_estimates\n    caption: Estimated judge severity d_j (positive = harsher)\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - d_j (mean)\n    - d_j (95% CI)\n    - Infit MNSQ\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '-0.83'\n      - '[-1.02, -0.64]'\n      - '0.94'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '-0.31'\n      - '[-0.48, -0.14]'\n      - '1.08'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '[-0.29, 0.05]'\n      - '1.02'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '0.91'\n      - '[0.72, 1.10]'\n      - '1.15'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '0.44'\n      - '[0.26, 0.62]'\n      - '1.21'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '0.62'\n      - '[0.43, 0.81]'\n      - '1.18'\n    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n      - '0.15'\n      - '[-0.03, 0.33]'\n      - '0.97'\n    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '[-0.40, -0.04]'\n      - '1.05'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Wright map (variable map): vertical axis = logit scale. Left side: model θ̂ distribution.\n    Right side: item b̂ distribution, judge d̂ points. Shows alignment of model ability\n    with item difficulty, plus judge spread.'\n  - 'c_n posterior density plot: 22 overlapping density curves (one per model), x-axis\n    = c_n. Top-quartile models clearly separated from bottom-quartile. Dashed vertical\n    line at c_n = 0 (no contamination reference).'\n  - 'θ shift scatter: x = Stage 1 θ̂ (MFRM), y = Stage 3 θ̂ (G-MFRM). Points colored\n    by c_n. High-c_n models shift downward (contamination correction), low-c_n models\n    stay near identity line.'\n  - 'Trace plots: 4 panels for representative θ, d, c, b parameters showing chain\n    mixing. Chains visually mixed but with mild autocorrelation visible in c_n traces.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在真实数据上收敛可接受但不如合成数据理想。τ = 0.823 vs MFRM 的 0.794 表明 contamination\n    修正提供了边际但正向的排名改善。关键观察：修正集中于 top-quartile c_n 模型（如 Qwen3-235B-A22B, c_n = 1.12），这些模型的\n    raw ranking 被系统性高估。 Judge severity 估计显示 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 最严厉（d = 0.91），GPT-5.5\n    最宽松（d = -0.83）， 范围 1.74 logits 对应约 1.5 个评分等级的系统偏差。这为 Claim 1 提供了直接证据： 如果不建模 d_j，contamination\n    信号会被 judge 差异所混淆。 Graceful degradation 通过验证——在低污染 item 子集上，Stage 3 结果与 Stage 1\n    近似。\n\n    '\n- name: baseline_comparison\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'Compare G-MFRM against 8 baselines. Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ\n    with Chatbot Arena. Include rank change analysis and post-hoc power analysis.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.761\n    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.794\n    kendall_tau_sequential_bias_first: 0.788\n    kendall_tau_sequential_contam_first: 0.791\n    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge: 0.802\n    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.798\n    kendall_tau_dcr: 0.779\n    kendall_tau_uda: 0.805\n    kendall_tau_prefleak: 0.783\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm: 0.823\n    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.857\n    spearman_rho_uda: 0.841\n    spearman_rho_mfrm: 0.831\n    best_baseline: UDA\n    best_baseline_tau: 0.805\n    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.018\n    delta_tau_p_value_wilcoxon: 0.067\n    delta_tau_95ci:\n    - 0.002\n    - 0.034\n    top5_overlap_gmfrm: 0.8\n    top5_overlap_uda: 0.8\n    top5_overlap_raw: 0.6\n    top10_overlap_gmfrm: 0.9\n    top10_overlap_uda: 0.8\n    top10_overlap_raw: 0.7\n    mean_absolute_rank_change_gmfrm_vs_raw: 2.3\n    max_rank_change_gmfrm_vs_raw: 5\n    models_with_rank_change_ge_3: 4\n    tau_gmfrm_high_contam_subset: 0.867\n    tau_uda_high_contam_subset: 0.782\n    tau_mfrm_high_contam_subset: 0.745\n    delta_tau_high_contam: 0.085\n    delta_tau_high_contam_p: 0.021\n    posthoc_power_full_sample: 0.58\n    posthoc_power_high_contam_subset: 0.74\n    n_models: 22\n    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.42\n    n_required_for_power_0_80: 35\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Δτ = 0.018（vs best baseline UDA），p = 0.067，borderline\n    significant。 这正是 median 档的核心特征：改善正向但小/边缘。原因链： (1) 真实 c_n 中位数 ≈ 0.48，多数模型污染较轻，MFRM\n    的 d_j 修正已捕获大部分偏差； (2) UDA 的神经网络 K-factor 调整能部分隐式学到 contamination 信号（尽管不可解释）， 所以\n    UDA 是最强 baseline；(3) CyclicJudge+discard 反而略低于 CyclicJudge alone， 因为丢弃高暴露 item\n    减少了信息量，在 N=22 模型下加大估计方差； (4) 关键亮点在 subset analysis：限制到 high-contamination top\n    quartile (c_n > 0.75) 时，Δτ = 0.085，p = 0.021——G-MFRM 优势集中于最需修正的模型。 Post-hoc power\n    = 0.58 < 0.80，说明 N=22 不足以可靠检测这个效应量。 这必须在论文中坦诚报告，但 subset analysis 部分缓解了 power\n    不足的叙事问题。 Sequential pipelines 两个方向（bias-first, contam-first）均劣于 joint estimation，\n    验证了 OVB confounding 的方向性预测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: main_comparison_table\n    caption: Method comparison on MT-Bench + Arena-Hard (Chatbot Arena Elo as reference)\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Kendall tau\n    - Spearman rho\n    - Top-5 Overlap\n    - Top-10 Overlap\n    - Mean |Rank Delta|\n    rows:\n    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n      - '0.761'\n      - '0.812'\n      - '0.6'\n      - '0.7'\n      - '3.1'\n    - - MFRM-only\n      - '0.794'\n      - '0.831'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '2.1'\n    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n      - '0.788'\n      - '0.824'\n      - '0.6'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '2.4'\n    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n      - '0.791'\n      - '0.828'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '2.2'\n    - - CyclicJudge\n      - '0.802'\n      - '0.838'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '1.9'\n    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n      - '0.798'\n      - '0.835'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '2.0'\n    - - DCR Factor\n      - '0.779'\n      - '0.821'\n      - '0.6'\n      - '0.7'\n      - '2.6'\n    - - UDA\n      - '0.805'\n      - '0.841'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '1.8'\n    - - PrefLeak Calibration\n      - '0.783'\n      - '0.822'\n      - '0.6'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '2.5'\n    - - G-MFRM (ours)\n      - '0.823'\n      - '0.857'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.9'\n      - '1.5'\n  - name: statistical_tests\n    caption: Pairwise Wilcoxon signed-rank tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\n    columns:\n    - Baseline\n    - Delta tau\n    - p-value\n    - Significant (alpha=0.05)?\n    rows:\n    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n      - '+0.062'\n      - '0.003'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - MFRM-only\n      - '+0.029'\n      - '0.042'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n      - '+0.035'\n      - '0.018'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n      - '+0.032'\n      - '0.024'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - CyclicJudge\n      - '+0.021'\n      - '0.089'\n      - 'No'\n    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n      - '+0.025'\n      - '0.058'\n      - 'No'\n    - - DCR Factor\n      - '+0.044'\n      - '0.008'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - UDA\n      - '+0.018'\n      - '0.067'\n      - 'No'\n    - - PrefLeak Calibration\n      - '+0.040'\n      - '0.011'\n      - 'Yes'\n  - name: subset_analysis\n    caption: G-MFRM advantage by contamination quartile\n    columns:\n    - c_n Quartile\n    - N Models\n    - c_n Range\n    - tau G-MFRM\n    - tau UDA\n    - Delta tau\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Q1 (lowest)\n      - '6'\n      - '[0.04, 0.18]'\n      - '0.807'\n      - '0.811'\n      - '-0.004'\n      - '0.812'\n    - - Q2\n      - '5'\n      - '[0.22, 0.48]'\n      - '0.815'\n      - '0.802'\n      - '+0.013'\n      - '0.234'\n    - - Q3\n      - '5'\n      - '[0.52, 0.75]'\n      - '0.831'\n      - '0.808'\n      - '+0.023'\n      - '0.109'\n    - - Q4 (highest)\n      - '6'\n      - '[0.85, 1.42]'\n      - '0.867'\n      - '0.782'\n      - '+0.085'\n      - '0.021'\n  - name: posthoc_power\n    caption: Post-hoc power analysis for primary comparison\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - N\n    - Observed Delta\n    - Cohen d\n    - Power (alpha=0.05)\n    - N for Power=0.80\n    rows:\n    - - G-MFRM vs UDA (all)\n      - '22'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '35'\n    - - G-MFRM vs UDA (Q4)\n      - '6'\n      - '0.085'\n      - '1.31'\n      - '0.74'\n      - '8'\n    - - G-MFRM vs Sequential\n      - '22'\n      - '0.032'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.76'\n      - '26'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Rank comparison alluvial diagram: flows from Arena Elo ranking (left) through\n    Raw Avg, UDA, G-MFRM rankings (right). Thick crossing flows highlight models whose\n    rank changes most under G-MFRM correction. Qwen3-235B-A22B drops from Raw rank\n    4 to G-MFRM rank 7.'\n  - 'Bootstrap Δτ distribution: histogram of 10,000 bootstrap resamples of τ(G-MFRM)\n    - τ(UDA). Distribution centered at 0.018, 95% CI [0.002, 0.034]. Dashed line at\n    0. ~3.2% mass below 0.'\n  - 'Subset analysis bar chart: Δτ (G-MFRM vs UDA) by c_n quartile. Clear monotonic\n    increase from Q1 (-0.004) to Q4 (+0.085). Error bars show 95% bootstrap CI. Q4\n    bar clearly above zero, Q1-Q2 overlap zero.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在全样本上优于所有 baseline，但 vs UDA 的改善仅 borderline significant (p=0.067)。叙事策略：(1)\n    全样本 Δτ 作为 Claim 3 的 \"comparable or better\" 证据； (2) Subset analysis 作为核心亮点——G-MFRM\n    优势高度集中于 high-contamination 模型； (3) Post-hoc power 分析坦诚报告 power=0.58，讨论 N=22 的限制，\n    建议未来工作扩展到 35+ models。 CyclicJudge+Discard 的反直觉结果（劣于 CyclicJudge alone）直接回应 Reviewer\n    Concern #1： 丢弃 item 损失信息，在小 N 下尤其有害。\n\n    '\n- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Estimate real contamination magnitude by comparing fitted c_n with\n    MVP synthetic assumptions. Validate c_n against ConStat per-model delta.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cn_median: 0.48\n    cn_mean: 0.56\n    cn_std: 0.39\n    cn_iqr:\n    - 0.18\n    - 0.82\n    cn_max: 1.42\n    cn_min: 0.04\n    closest_mvp_regime: between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5)\n    fraction_models_mvp001_regime: 0.68\n    fraction_models_mvp002_regime: 0.18\n    fraction_models_near_zero: 0.14\n    cn_constat_pearson_r: 0.52\n    cn_constat_spearman_rho: 0.56\n    cn_constat_p_value: 0.013\n    cn_constat_n: 22\n    theta_bias_high_cn_mean: 0.21\n    theta_bias_low_cn_mean: 0.03\n    theta_bias_scatter_r: 0.35\n    tier_determination: B\n    narrative_recommendation: diagnostics as co-primary\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下真实 c_n 中位数 ≈ 0.48，接近 mvp_001 的 c ≈ 0.5 水平。68% 的模型处于\n    weak contamination 区间（c_n < 0.8），仅 18% 接近 mvp_002 的强污染水平。 这决定了 Tier B 叙事：ranking\n    improvement 正向但 modest。 ConStat 验证相关 r = 0.52 处于 [0.4, 0.65] 范围中部——c_n 和 ConStat\n    delta 测量的是相关但不完全相同的构念（G-MFRM c_n 条件于 d_j 和 b_i，ConStat delta 是 无条件测量），所以中等相关是合理的。高于\n    0.4 表明 c_n 有外部效度； 低于 0.7 表明两者不是冗余的，G-MFRM 提供了独立信息。 θ-bias scatter r = 0.35 证明\n    confounding 机制存在但效应量 modest： high-c_n 模型的 θ̂ 平均高估 0.21 logits，但对于 low-c_n 模型影响\n    ≤ 0.03。 这将 Claim 1 锁定在 \"detectable mechanism\" 层面，而非 \"large practical impact\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: cn_distribution_summary\n    caption: Real c_n distribution vs MVP synthetic assumptions\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Real Data\n    - mvp_001\n    - mvp_002\n    - mvp_003\n    rows:\n    - - Median c_n\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.5'\n      - '1.5'\n      - '1.5'\n    - - Mean c_n\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.5'\n      - '1.5'\n      - '1.5'\n    - - Std c_n\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.5'\n      - '0.5'\n    - - Max c_n\n      - '1.42'\n      - '1.0'\n      - '2.5'\n      - '2.5'\n    - - Fraction c_n > 1.0\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.84'\n  - name: cn_per_model\n    caption: Per-model c_n estimates with ConStat validation\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - G-MFRM c_n\n    - c_n 95% CI\n    - ConStat Delta\n    - Arena Elo\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '1.42'\n      - '[0.98, 1.91]'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '1271'\n    - - GPT-4.5\n      - '0.72'\n      - '[0.41, 1.08]'\n      - '0.51'\n      - '1258'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '0.85'\n      - '[0.52, 1.22]'\n      - '0.61'\n      - '1224'\n    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n      - '0.58'\n      - '[0.29, 0.91]'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '1329'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '0.41'\n      - '[0.15, 0.71]'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '1298'\n    - - Mistral-Large-3\n      - '0.38'\n      - '[0.12, 0.68]'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '1241'\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '0.31'\n      - '[0.08, 0.58]'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '1347'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '0.22'\n      - '[0.03, 0.47]'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '1338'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '0.15'\n      - '[0.01, 0.38]'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '1311'\n    - - Llama-4-Maverick\n      - '0.09'\n      - '[0.00, 0.28]'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '1285'\n  - name: theta_bias_by_cn_group\n    caption: Mean θ̂ overestimation by c_n group (Stage 1 MFRM vs Stage 3 G-MFRM)\n    columns:\n    - c_n Group\n    - N\n    - Mean c_n\n    - Mean theta bias\n    - Std theta bias\n    rows:\n    - - Low (c_n < 0.25)\n      - '6'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.04'\n    - - Medium (0.25-0.75)\n      - '10'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.07'\n    - - High (c_n > 0.75)\n      - '6'\n      - '1.08'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.09'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'c_n vs ConStat delta scatter: 22 points, x = G-MFRM c_n, y = ConStat per-model\n    delta. Pearson r = 0.52 (95% CI [0.14, 0.77]). Regression line with prediction\n    interval. Points colored by model family.'\n  - 'c_n posterior violin plots: 22 violins sorted by posterior mean. Half-Cauchy\n    prior shape visible in near-zero models. Top 4 models clearly separated from the\n    rest.'\n  - 'θ-bias scatter: x = c_n, y = Δθ̂ (MFRM minus G-MFRM). Positive relationship (r\n    = 0.35) confirms high-c_n models are systematically overestimated by MFRM. Horizontal\n    band at Δθ = 0 for low-c_n models.'\n  analysis: '实验确认 Tier B 叙事。真实污染处于 weak-to-moderate 水平，大多数模型 c_n < 0.8。 ConStat 外部验证\n    r = 0.52 支持 c_n 的构念效度。θ-bias 分析为 Claim 1 提供了 方向性证据——confounding 存在且可检测，但实际影响对\n    68% 的模型而言很小。 论文叙事应聚焦 top-quartile 模型（c_n > 0.75）的修正价值，同时将 per-model c_n 本身（作为\n    training data audit 工具）提升为 co-primary contribution。 Qwen3-235B-A22B 的 c_n = 1.42\n    是最显著案例——将在论文中作为 case study 展示。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'Sensitivity analysis: vary judge count (2, 4, 6, 8) and measure G-MFRM\n    performance. Include leave-one-judge-out preference leakage diagnostic.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_8_judges: 0.823\n    tau_6_judges: 0.812\n    tau_4_judges: 0.791\n    tau_2_judges: 0.768\n    tau_mfrm_8_judges: 0.794\n    tau_mfrm_4_judges: 0.779\n    tau_mfrm_2_judges: 0.765\n    min_judges_gmfrm_gt_mfrm: 4\n    rhat_8_judges: 1.06\n    rhat_6_judges: 1.07\n    rhat_4_judges: 1.09\n    rhat_2_judges: 1.18\n    ess_8_judges: 132\n    ess_6_judges: 108\n    ess_4_judges: 84\n    ess_2_judges: 41\n    cn_rmse_8_judges: 0.39\n    cn_rmse_4_judges: 0.58\n    cn_rmse_2_judges: 1.21\n    max_residual_shift_same_family: 0.14\n    max_residual_shift_cross_family: 0.06\n    preference_leakage_detected_pairs: 2\n    preference_leakage_models: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (judged by Claude Opus 4.7), Qwen3.6-27B\n      (judged by Qwen3-235B-A22B)\n  result_rationale: 'Judge count sensitivity 在 median 档下呈现明确的阈值行为： (1) 2 judges 时\n    G-MFRM 退化至 MFRM 水平——c_n 和 d_j 信号无法分离（R̂=1.18, ESS=41 表明 c_n 参数未收敛），验证了论文预期的 graceful\n    degradation； (2) 4 judges 是 G-MFRM 开始稳定超越 MFRM 的最小配置（Δτ ≈ 0.012，ESS=84 勉强可接受）；\n    (3) 6→8 judges 的边际提升递减（Δτ = 0.011），说明 8 judges 接近饱和。 Leave-one-judge-out 检测到 2\n    个 preference leakage 对：同家族 judge 评价同家族模型时 残差系统性偏移 ≈ 0.14 logits。这低于 d_j 的典型范围（1.74\n    logits）， 但足以在论文中报告为 \"detectable but not dominant\"。Median 档下 leakage 效应 不足以要求 f_{nj}\n    交互项（添加会导致过参数化），但应在 Limitations 中讨论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: judge_count_curve\n    caption: G-MFRM performance by number of judges\n    columns:\n    - N Judges\n    - tau G-MFRM\n    - tau MFRM\n    - Delta\n    - R-hat max\n    - ESS min\n    - c_n RMSE\n    rows:\n    - - '2'\n      - '0.768'\n      - '0.765'\n      - '+0.003'\n      - '1.18'\n      - '41'\n      - '1.21'\n    - - '4'\n      - '0.791'\n      - '0.779'\n      - '+0.012'\n      - '1.09'\n      - '84'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - '6'\n      - '0.812'\n      - '0.789'\n      - '+0.023'\n      - '1.07'\n      - '108'\n      - '0.46'\n    - - '8'\n      - '0.823'\n      - '0.794'\n      - '+0.029'\n      - '1.06'\n      - '132'\n      - '0.39'\n  - name: leakage_diagnostic\n    caption: Leave-one-judge-out residual analysis for preference leakage\n    columns:\n    - Removed Judge\n    - Most Affected Model\n    - Residual Shift\n    - Same Family?\n    - Significant?\n    rows:\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '-0.14'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Yes (p=0.032)\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '-0.11'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Yes (p=0.048)\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - GPT-4.5\n      - '-0.08'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - No (p=0.127)\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - DeepSeek-V3-Base\n      - '+0.06'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - No (p=0.312)\n    - - Gemini-2.5-Pro\n      - Gemini-2.0-Flash\n      - '-0.05'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - No (p=0.389)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Judge count sensitivity curve: x = N judges, y = Kendall τ. Two lines (G-MFRM,\n    MFRM). G-MFRM curve above MFRM for N ≥ 4, converging at N = 2. Shaded region shows\n    95% CI from judge subset bootstrap.'\n  - 'Convergence diagnostic by judge count: 2-panel. Left: R̂ max vs N judges (threshold\n    line at 1.10). Right: ESS min vs N judges (threshold line at 100). Both show clear\n    improvement with more judges.'\n  - 'Leave-one-judge-out residual heatmap: rows = judges removed, columns = models.\n    Color intensity = residual shift magnitude. Same-family cells highlighted with\n    border. Two significant cells visible.'\n  analysis: '4 judges 是 G-MFRM 实用性的最低配置。论文应建议 6+ judges 作为推荐配置， 并明确说明 2 judges 时 G-MFRM\n    自动退化为 MFRM（功能降级而非失败）。 Preference leakage 在 2/5 个同家族对中显著但效应量小， 支持 \"detectable but\n    absorbed into θ̂ uniformly\" 的论文立场。\n\n    '\n- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Ablation study: contribution of each e_i source to final pipeline\n    quality. Leave-one-out analysis on e_i estimation and downstream θ̂ accuracy.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_pipeline_ei_consistency: 0.43\n    full_pipeline_theta_tau: 0.823\n    full_pipeline_cn_constat_r: 0.52\n    without_performance_gap_tau: 0.786\n    without_temporal_tau: 0.818\n    without_logprober_tau: 0.812\n    without_performance_gap_cn_r: 0.31\n    without_temporal_cn_r: 0.49\n    without_logprober_cn_r: 0.44\n    only_performance_gap_tau: 0.814\n    only_temporal_tau: 0.788\n    only_logprober_tau: 0.795\n    optimal_weight_gap: 0.62\n    optimal_weight_temporal: 0.18\n    optimal_weight_logprober: 0.2\n    weight_sensitivity_tau_range:\n    - 0.81\n    - 0.825\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 e_i pipeline 的三个 source 贡献不对称：performance gap 是主要信号源，\n    移除后 τ 下降最大（0.823→0.786），因为它直接测量 \"original vs rephrased\" 的分数差—— 最接近 contamination\n    的操作性定义。Temporal signal 贡献最弱（移除后 τ 仅降 0.005）， 因为其覆盖率仅 41% 且许多 item 的时间切分不精确。LogProber\n    居中——它捕获 verbatim 记忆（与 performance gap 的 \"能力增益\" 部分互补），但受限于 API 模型可用性。 性能对权重组合不太敏感（τ\n    在 [0.810, 0.825] 范围内），说明三个 source 的信号 方向一致但噪声不同。单独使用 performance gap 已能达到总效果的\n    ~80%—— 这简化了实际部署：practitioners 只需构建 reference variants，不必部署 LogProber。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ablation_results\n    caption: 'e_i source ablation: impact on downstream G-MFRM performance'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - N Sources\n    - tau (Arena)\n    - c_n-ConStat r\n    - Delta tau vs Full\n    rows:\n    - - Full Pipeline\n      - '3'\n      - '0.823'\n      - '0.52'\n      - —\n    - - w/o Performance Gap\n      - '2'\n      - '0.786'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '-0.037'\n    - - w/o Temporal Signal\n      - '2'\n      - '0.818'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '-0.005'\n    - - w/o LogProber\n      - '2'\n      - '0.812'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '-0.011'\n    - - Only Performance Gap\n      - '1'\n      - '0.814'\n      - '0.46'\n      - '-0.009'\n    - - Only Temporal\n      - '1'\n      - '0.788'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '-0.035'\n    - - Only LogProber\n      - '1'\n      - '0.795'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '-0.028'\n    - - MFRM (no e_i)\n      - '0'\n      - '0.794'\n      - —\n      - '-0.029'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Ablation bar chart: 7 configurations, y = Kendall τ. Horizontal dashed line at\n    full pipeline (0.823) and MFRM baseline (0.794). Error bars from 5-fold CV on\n    e_i weight optimization.'\n  - 'Source contribution Venn diagram: three overlapping circles (Gap, Temporal, LogProber)\n    with unique and shared variance proportions. Gap has largest unique contribution\n    (~45%), shared region (~20%).'\n  analysis: 'Performance gap 是 e_i pipeline 的核心，其他 source 提供增量但非必须。 论文应将 full pipeline\n    作为主要报告，但在 practical recommendations 中 指出单源（performance gap only）是可行的简化方案，τ 损失仅\n    0.009。 这增强了方法的实际可部署性。\n\n    '\n- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Measurement quality validation: infit/outfit, person-fit statistics,\n    posterior predictive checks, divergent transitions, trace plots.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theta_infit_range:\n    - 0.82\n    - 1.28\n    theta_outfit_range:\n    - 0.78\n    - 1.35\n    theta_misfit_count: 2\n    b_infit_range:\n    - 0.71\n    - 1.42\n    b_outfit_range:\n    - 0.65\n    - 1.58\n    b_misfit_count: 38\n    b_misfit_fraction: 0.058\n    d_infit_range:\n    - 0.94\n    - 1.21\n    d_outfit_range:\n    - 0.88\n    - 1.31\n    d_misfit_count: 1\n    lz_cn_pearson_r: 0.41\n    lz_cn_spearman_rho: 0.45\n    emri_cn_pearson_r: 0.38\n    ppc_mean_residual: 0.02\n    ppc_residual_std: 0.31\n    ppc_outlier_fraction: 0.047\n    divergent_transitions_total: 14\n    divergent_transitions_fraction: 0.0007\n    max_treedepth_fraction: 0.032\n    p_waic: 187\n    waic_gmfrm: -42381\n    waic_mfrm: -41892\n    delta_waic: -489\n    delta_waic_se: 124\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 facet fit 总体可接受但有局部问题： (1) 38 个 item（5.8%）misfit，主要是\n    Arena-Hard 的 coding 题（这些题评分分布 高度双峰——要么完全正确要么完全错误，不符合 Rasch 的连续性假设）； (2) 2 个 model\n    misfit（infit > 1.28），likely 因其能力 profile 在不同 item 类别间 高度不一致（如某模型 coding 极强但 humanities\n    极弱），违反 unidimensionality； (3) lz-c_n 相关 r = 0.41 表明 person-fit 异常部分（但非全部）可被 contamination\n    解释—— 这支持 c_n 作为独立参数的必要性，而非仅靠 misfit detection 替代； (4) ΔWAIC = -489 ± 124 支持 G-MFRM\n    优于 MFRM 的模型选择，即使排名改善 modest； (5) Divergent transitions 0.07% 在可接受范围内，主要集中在 near-zero\n    c_n 模型 （Half-Cauchy prior 在零附近的梯度问题），不影响整体推断。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: fit_statistics_summary\n    caption: Facet fit statistics summary\n    columns:\n    - Facet\n    - N\n    - Infit MNSQ Range\n    - Outfit MNSQ Range\n    - Misfit Count\n    - Misfit Fraction\n    rows:\n    - - Model (theta)\n      - '22'\n      - '[0.82, 1.28]'\n      - '[0.78, 1.35]'\n      - '2'\n      - '0.091'\n    - - Item (b)\n      - '660'\n      - '[0.71, 1.42]'\n      - '[0.65, 1.58]'\n      - '38'\n      - '0.058'\n    - - Judge (d)\n      - '8'\n      - '[0.94, 1.21]'\n      - '[0.88, 1.31]'\n      - '1'\n      - '0.125'\n    - - Contamination (c)\n      - '22'\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: personfit_vs_cn\n    caption: Person-fit statistic correlation with contamination estimate\n    columns:\n    - Person-fit Statistic\n    - Correlation with c_n\n    - p-value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - lz (standardized)\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.058'\n      - Moderate; c_n captures part of lz signal\n    - - EMRi\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.081'\n      - Moderate; similar to lz\n    - - Infit MNSQ\n      - '0.29'\n      - '0.192'\n      - Weak; misfit not solely from contamination\n  - name: model_comparison_waic\n    caption: Model comparison via WAIC\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - WAIC\n    - p_WAIC\n    - Delta WAIC\n    - SE(Delta)\n    rows:\n    - - G-MFRM (Stage 3)\n      - '-42381'\n      - '187'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - MFRM (Stage 1)\n      - '-41892'\n      - '142'\n      - '+489'\n      - '124'\n    - - Raw IRT (no facets)\n      - '-39847'\n      - '68'\n      - '+2534'\n      - '312'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Infit/outfit bubble chart: x = infit, y = outfit, bubble size = c_n. Rectangle\n    shows acceptable range [0.70, 1.30]. Misfitting items labeled. High-c_n models\n    tend toward upper-right (overfit pattern).'\n  - 'Posterior predictive check: observed vs predicted score distribution, overlaid.\n    4 panels for different model ability quartiles. Fit is good for mid-range models,\n    slight underprediction at extremes.'\n  - 'Trace plots: 4 × 4 grid showing θ_1, d_1, c_1, b_1 traces across 4 chains. Visual\n    mixing adequate for θ and d; mild autocorrelation in c_n (ESS lower); b well-mixed.'\n  - 'lz vs c_n scatter: x = c_n, y = lz statistic. Moderate positive trend (r = 0.41).\n    Points above lz = 2 threshold labeled. Not all high-c_n models are high-lz, confirming\n    c_n captures distinct signal.'\n  analysis: 'Diagnostics 支持 G-MFRM 的测量质量，但需在论文中报告 misfitting items 和 convergence 细节。WAIC\n    比较提供了统计层面的模型选择证据（ΔW = -489 ± 124， 约 4σ 显著），即使 τ 改善 modest。lz-c_n 的中等相关是叙事亮点： 传统\n    person-fit 能检测 \"something wrong\" 但不能归因；G-MFRM 的 c_n 提供 可解释的归因——\"this model''s\n    anomalous response pattern is partly explained by contamination susceptibility\"。这直接支持\n    diagnostics-as-co-primary 叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: confounding_formal_observation\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'Formal OVB bias derivation + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n\n    point-estimate validation.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bias_formula_derived: true\n    bias_direction_prediction: overestimation when Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i) > 0\n    bias_magnitude_first_order: β_OVB ≈ Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i) / Var(d_j)\n    mc_replications: 1000\n    mc_bias_direction_correct_fraction: 0.91\n    mc_bias_magnitude_rmse: 0.08\n    mc_sequential_bias_first_theta_bias: 0.13\n    mc_sequential_contam_first_theta_bias: 0.11\n    mc_joint_theta_bias: 0.02\n    mc_joint_theta_rmse: 0.13\n    mc_sequential_theta_rmse: 0.19\n    mc_rmse_reduction: 0.316\n    confounding_scatter_r: 0.35\n    confounding_scatter_p: 0.002\n    cn_point_rmse: 0.44\n    cn_95ci_coverage: 0.88\n    cn_corr_with_true: 0.82\n    cn_mean_bias: 0.06\n    rho_sweep_values:\n    - 0.0\n    - 0.15\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.45\n    - 0.6\n    bias_at_rho_0: 0.01\n    bias_at_rho_0_15: 0.05\n    bias_at_rho_0_30: 0.1\n    bias_at_rho_0_45: 0.15\n    bias_at_rho_0_60: 0.21\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Monte Carlo 验证了 OVB 机制但效应量 moderate： (1) Bias direction\n    正确率 91%（非 100% 因为有限样本噪声在低 ρ 时可逆转方向）； (2) Sequential bias ≈ 0.11-0.13 logits，处于\n    \"≤ 0.15 for most models\" 的范围内； (3) Joint estimation 大幅降低 bias 至 0.02（接近无偏），RMSE\n    降低 31.6%， 但这是在受控合成数据上——真实数据效果会因 e_i 噪声而打折； (4) Confounding scatter r = 0.35 处于\n    [0.25, 0.45] 中部，低于 mvp_002/003 的 r = 0.65（后者是强污染下的结果），反映 median 档下信号较弱； (5) c_n\n    点估计回收 RMSE = 0.44，95% CI 覆盖率 88%——略低于 nominal 95%， 说明 posterior 有轻微欠覆盖（Half-Cauchy\n    prior 在高 c_n 值时约束过强）， 但对 c_n 排序而言足够（corr = 0.82）。 ρ sweep 清楚展示了 bias 随 confounding\n    强度单调递增，为 Section 2 的 \"Observation\" 提供了直观的教学图表。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: monte_carlo_bias_summary\n    caption: Monte Carlo bias validation (1000 replications, ρ = 0.30)\n    columns:\n    - Estimator\n    - Mean theta bias\n    - Theta RMSE\n    - RMSE vs Joint\n    rows:\n    - - Joint G-MFRM\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.13'\n      - —\n    - - Sequential (bias-first)\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.19'\n      - +46.2%\n    - - Sequential (contam-first)\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.18'\n      - +38.5%\n    - - MFRM-only (ignore c)\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.20'\n      - +53.8%\n    - - Raw average\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.38'\n      - +192.3%\n  - name: rho_sweep\n    caption: Sequential estimator bias as function of confounding strength ρ\n    columns:\n    - rho(d,ce)\n    - Sequential Bias\n    - Joint Bias\n    - Bias Ratio\n    rows:\n    - - '0.00'\n      - '0.01'\n      - '0.01'\n      - '1.0'\n    - - '0.15'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.01'\n      - '5.0'\n    - - '0.30'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '5.0'\n    - - '0.45'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '7.5'\n    - - '0.60'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '7.0'\n  - name: cn_recovery\n    caption: Synthetic c_n recovery statistics\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Acceptable Threshold\n    rows:\n    - - Point RMSE\n      - '0.44'\n      - < 0.60\n    - - 95% CI Coverage\n      - '0.88'\n      - '> 0.90 (marginal)'\n    - - Correlation with true c_n\n      - '0.82'\n      - '> 0.70'\n    - - Mean bias\n      - '+0.06'\n      - < 0.10\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bias vs ρ curve: x = ρ(d, c·e), y = mean θ̂ bias. Two lines (sequential, joint).\n    Sequential rises linearly; joint stays near zero. Shaded bands show MC 95% intervals.\n    This is the key Section 2 figure.'\n  - 'Confounding scatter: x = true θ - θ̂_sequential, y = c_n. Positive correlation\n    (r = 0.35). High-c_n models are overestimated by sequential. Regression line with\n    95% CI.'\n  - 'c_n recovery: x = true c_n, y = estimated c_n. Identity line. 95% CI whiskers\n    per point. Most points near identity but with scatter (RMSE = 0.44). Coverage\n    slightly below nominal at high c_n values.'\n  analysis: 'OVB Observation 在合成数据上得到清晰验证。ρ sweep 图是 Section 2 的核心—— 直观展示 confounding\n    如何随 ρ 增长导致 sequential bias 线性增长，而 joint estimation 保持无偏。c_n 回收的 88% coverage 需在\n    Limitations 中提及—— posterior 在高 c_n 处略偏窄，可能因 Half-Cauchy 先验的约束效应。 Confounding scatter\n    r = 0.35 足以支持 \"mechanism exists\"（Claim 1）的 median 档表述。\n\n    '\n- name: wildbench_replication\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'Replicate G-MFRM pipeline on WildBench as third benchmark for cross-benchmark\n    generalization.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    wildbench_items: 1024\n    wildbench_judges_used: 6\n    wildbench_models_evaluated: 18\n    wildbench_tau_gmfrm: 0.808\n    wildbench_tau_mfrm: 0.786\n    wildbench_tau_raw: 0.749\n    wildbench_tau_uda: 0.793\n    wildbench_delta_tau_vs_uda: 0.015\n    wildbench_delta_p: 0.094\n    wildbench_cn_median: 0.38\n    wildbench_cn_correlation_with_mtbench_cn: 0.71\n    wildbench_rhat_max: 1.08\n    wildbench_ess_min: 96\n    wildbench_runtime_seconds: 11240\n    wildbench_ei_mean: 0.26\n    wildbench_ei_internal_consistency: 0.37\n  result_rationale: 'WildBench 的 c_n 中位数（0.38）低于 MT-Bench+Arena-Hard（0.48），因为 WildBench\n    发布较晚、item 更多样且更接近真实用户 query（更难被训练数据直接覆盖）。 这进一步压缩了 G-MFRM 的排名改善空间（Δτ = 0.015 vs\n    UDA，p = 0.094 不显著）。 但跨 benchmark 的 c_n 一致性高（r = 0.71）——同一模型在不同 benchmark 上的 contamination\n    susceptibility 相关，支持 c_n 作为 \"model-level trait\" 的构念效度。 收敛性比主实验略差（R̂=1.08, ESS=96），可能因\n    6 judges（而非 8）降低了信息量。 e_i 内部一致性更低（0.37 vs 0.43），因为 WildBench 的 item 更长更复杂， reference\n    variant 构建质量下降。这是跨 benchmark 泛化的实际成本。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: cross_benchmark_comparison\n    caption: G-MFRM performance across benchmarks\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - N Items\n    - N Judges\n    - tau G-MFRM\n    - tau UDA\n    - Delta tau\n    - p-value\n    - c_n median\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - '160'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.811'\n      - '0.798'\n      - '+0.013'\n      - '0.112'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - Arena-Hard\n      - '500'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.831'\n      - '0.812'\n      - '+0.019'\n      - '0.054'\n      - '0.44'\n    - - WildBench\n      - '1024'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.808'\n      - '0.793'\n      - '+0.015'\n      - '0.094'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Combined (MT+AH)\n      - '660'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.823'\n      - '0.805'\n      - '+0.018'\n      - '0.067'\n      - '0.48'\n  - name: cn_cross_benchmark\n    caption: Cross-benchmark c_n consistency (Pearson correlation)\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark Pair\n    - Shared Models\n    - c_n Correlation\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard\n      - '22'\n      - '0.78'\n      - < 0.001\n    - - MT-Bench vs WildBench\n      - '18'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.002'\n    - - Arena-Hard vs WildBench\n      - '18'\n      - '0.74'\n      - < 0.001\n    - - (MT+AH) vs WildBench\n      - '18'\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.001'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-benchmark c_n scatter: 3 panels (MT vs AH, MT vs WB, AH vs WB). Each panel\n    shows per-model c_n on x and y axes. Strong positive correlations confirm c_n\n    is a stable model-level property across benchmarks.'\n  - 'Per-benchmark Δτ forest plot: 3 rows (MT-Bench, Arena-Hard, WildBench) showing\n    Δτ ± 95% CI. All positive, all overlap zero at lower bound. Pooled estimate shown\n    at bottom.'\n  analysis: 'WildBench 复制确认了 G-MFRM 的跨 benchmark 泛化性，但效应量更小（lower contamination）。\n    核心价值在于 c_n 跨 benchmark 一致性（r = 0.68-0.78）——证明 contamination susceptibility 是 model-level\n    trait 而非 benchmark artifact。 论文应将此作为 c_n 构念效度的额外证据，而非第三个独立的排名改善论证。\n\n    '\n- name: adversarial_robustness\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'Test G-MFRM robustness against adversarial contamination following\n    Wang et al. (ICLR 2026).\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    adversarial_types_tested: 3\n    adversarial_models_injected: 4\n    cn_detection_auc_mild: 0.78\n    cn_detection_auc_moderate: 0.84\n    cn_detection_auc_severe: 0.91\n    theta_rank_corruption_without_gmfrm: 3.2\n    theta_rank_corruption_with_gmfrm: 1.1\n    rank_protection_rate: 0.66\n    undetectable_adversarial_fraction: 0.22\n    failure_mode: Adversarial contamination that mimics genuine ability gain (uniform\n      across items) is undetectable by rank-1 c·e gating\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 的防御是 partial： (1)\n    Severe contamination（大幅度、item-specific 的性能膨胀）被 c_n 可靠检测（AUC=0.91）， 因为 rank-1 c·e\n    结构能捕获 item-specific 膨胀模式； (2) Mild contamination（小幅度、接近均匀的膨胀）检测 AUC 降至 0.78，因为均匀膨胀\n    与真实能力提升难以区分——这是 rank-1 假设的根本限制； (3) 22% 的 adversarial 模式完全不可检测——特别是\"能力伪装型\"污染 （在所有\n    item 上均匀小幅提升），被吸收进 θ̂ 而非 c_n。 Rank protection rate 0.66 表明 G-MFRM 缓解了约 2/3 的排名腐蚀，\n    但不是完全防御。论文应在 Limitations 中坦诚讨论这一边界。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: adversarial_detection\n    caption: G-MFRM adversarial contamination detection performance\n    columns:\n    - Adversarial Type\n    - Severity\n    - c_n AUC\n    - Rank Corruption w/o G-MFRM\n    - Rank Corruption w/ G-MFRM\n    rows:\n    - - Data Poisoning\n      - Mild\n      - '0.76'\n      - '1.8'\n      - '0.9'\n    - - Data Poisoning\n      - Severe\n      - '0.92'\n      - '4.1'\n      - '1.2'\n    - - Prompt Injection\n      - Mild\n      - '0.74'\n      - '1.5'\n      - '0.8'\n    - - Prompt Injection\n      - Severe\n      - '0.88'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '1.4'\n    - - Benchmark Memorization\n      - Mild\n      - '0.83'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '0.7'\n    - - Benchmark Memorization\n      - Severe\n      - '0.93'\n      - '4.5'\n      - '0.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Adversarial ROC curves: 3 panels (one per adversarial type), each with mild/moderate/severe\n    severity curves. AUC annotated. All above chance; severe curves approach upper-left.'\n  - 'Rank corruption bar chart: paired bars (without G-MFRM, with G-MFRM) for each\n    adversarial condition. Clear reduction in all conditions but residual corruption\n    persists.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM 提供了 meaningful 但非完美的 adversarial 防御。论文应定位为 \"G-MFRM detects and\n    mitigates item-specific contamination patterns (rank-1 structure); uniform adversarial\n    inflation remains a fundamental detection limit shared by all item-level analysis\n    methods.\" Rank-k 扩展作为 future work 指向。\n\n    '\n- name: error_propagation_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Sensitivity analysis for staged estimation: inject Gaussian noise\n    into e_i at σ=0.1,0.2,0.5. Measure θ̂ RMSE degradation and c_n recovery accuracy.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sigma_0_theta_rmse: 0.128\n    sigma_0_theta_tau: 0.916\n    sigma_0_cn_rmse: 0.53\n    sigma_0_cn_corr: 0.86\n    sigma_01_theta_rmse: 0.13\n    sigma_01_theta_tau: 0.915\n    sigma_01_cn_rmse: 0.55\n    sigma_01_cn_corr: 0.85\n    sigma_01_delta_theta_pct: 1.6\n    sigma_01_delta_cn_pct: 3.8\n    sigma_02_theta_rmse: 0.136\n    sigma_02_theta_tau: 0.914\n    sigma_02_cn_rmse: 0.58\n    sigma_02_cn_corr: 0.84\n    sigma_02_delta_theta_pct: 6.3\n    sigma_02_delta_cn_pct: 9.4\n    sigma_05_theta_rmse: 0.175\n    sigma_05_theta_tau: 0.885\n    sigma_05_cn_rmse: 0.84\n    sigma_05_cn_corr: 0.75\n    sigma_05_delta_theta_pct: 36.7\n    sigma_05_delta_cn_pct: 58.5\n    all_converged: true\n    rhat_max_all: 1.02\n    robust_threshold: 0.2\n    verdict: PARTIAL — robust at σ ≤ 0.2, exceeds threshold at σ = 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 e_i 的有效 σ ≈ 0.24，恰好处于 robust (σ≤0.2) 和 degraded (σ=0.5)\n    之间的过渡区。这意味着真实数据的 Stage 3 结果会经历 ~6-10% 的 θ 精度损失 （相对于 oracle e_i），但不会崩溃。关键观察：θ̂\n    对 e_i 噪声的鲁棒性优于 c_n 的 鲁棒性——σ=0.2 时 θ RMSE 仅增 6.3% 但 c_n RMSE 增 9.4%。这是因为 θ̂ 同时受\n    多个 item 的约束（聚合效应缓冲了 e_i 噪声），而 c_n 直接依赖 e_i·c_n 的乘积项， 噪声传播更直接。σ=0.5 的结果（θ degradation\n    36.7%）是上界估计——说明如果 e_i pipeline 完全失效，staged estimation 的优势将大幅削减。论文应引用此结果论证： \"Stage\n    2 e_i 估计质量是系统性能的关键瓶颈，但在当前 pipeline（σ ≈ 0.2-0.25）下 性能退化在可接受范围内。\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: sensitivity_results\n    caption: Error propagation sensitivity analysis (20 synthetic replications per\n      σ)\n    columns:\n    - sigma_e\n    - theta RMSE\n    - theta tau\n    - c_n RMSE\n    - c_n Corr\n    - Delta theta %\n    - Delta c_n %\n    rows:\n    - - '0.0'\n      - '0.128'\n      - '0.916'\n      - '0.53'\n      - '0.86'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - '0.1'\n      - '0.130'\n      - '0.915'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.85'\n      - +1.6%\n      - +3.8%\n    - - '0.2'\n      - '0.136'\n      - '0.914'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.84'\n      - +6.3%\n      - +9.4%\n    - - '0.5'\n      - '0.175'\n      - '0.885'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.75'\n      - +36.7%\n      - +58.5%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Degradation curve: x = σ_e, y = metric value (dual axis: θ RMSE left, c_n correlation\n    right). Both degrade monotonically but θ is more robust. Vertical dashed line\n    at σ = 0.24 (estimated real e_i noise level). Shaded acceptable region.'\n  - 'Per-model c_n scatter at each σ level: 4 panels. As σ increases, scatter around\n    identity line widens. σ=0.5 panel shows severe degradation especially for small\n    c_n values (noise overwhelms signal).'\n  analysis: 已完成实验，实际结果与 median 档预测高度一致（实际 σ=0.2 时 θ RMSE +5.9%， 预测 +6.3%）。论文的关键论证：staged\n    estimation 在合理 e_i 噪声下（σ ≤ 0.2） 足够鲁棒，这使得 \"conditional joint estimation\" 成为可辩护的设计选择——\n    无需完全联合估计（under-identified）即可获得稳健结果。 σ = 0.5 的结果作为 worst-case 上界在 Limitations 中讨论。\n","numLines":1719,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1719}}}
